ibility to reprint the ticket there.","5":"Consider foregoing the concert to support Ted, forming a Plan B such as going to a nearby bar or restaurant for fun.","6":"R_1ZkmnFe2xKTk50J"},"15":{"1":"Call the customer service of the concert venue or ticket provider to ask about their policy for forgotten tickets, and if they can provide a digital ticket.","2":"Ask nearby attendees or staff if tickets can be purchased at the door, to avoid the need for Ted to return home.","3":"Suggest Ted to ask his housemates or family members to take a picture of his ticket and send it digitally, in case the venue accepts digital tickets.","4":"Delay entering the concert temporarily and look for possible solutions online such as reprinting the ticket at the venue or getting it digitally.","5":"Consider sharing one of the group member's ticket, if they are general admission tickets. One person could enter first and then pass the ticket back to Ted outside so he can use it to get in.","6":"R_1d1sQwl1ukvRluN"},"16":{"1":"Negotiate with the concert officials to allow Ted to enter without his ticket by showing his online purchase receipt or identification.","2":"Have Ted stay at the venue while someone else quickly takes a cab to fetch his ticket from his house.","3":"Use a smartphone to make a digital copy of the ticket if Ted has a copy at home, then share it with him electronically.","4":"Consider purchasing a new ticket for Ted on-site or online if available and affordable.","5":"Ask around to see if anyone is selling an extra ticket at the venue.","6":"R_1kjI7iAWjtWuBtD"},"17":{"1":"Ask the ticket office if they can reprint Ted's ticket or verify his purchase electronically.","2":"Check if Ted's ticket can be accessed digitally on his smartphone, possibly via an email confirmation or through an app.","3":"Offer to wait with Ted while he takes a quick taxi or rideshare back to his house to get his ticket.","4":"Consider sacrificing the start of the concert and go back to the house wit