 given that he's already bought it, and provide any needed confirmation details.","2":"Darya and her friends could decide to wait with Ted while he arranges for a friend or family member to bring the ticket.","3":"Ted could use a ride sharing app to get someone to pick up the ticket from his house and deliver it to him at the concert venue, thus minimizing the waiting time.","4":"If the tickets were bought online, Darya could suggest Ted to check his email or the ticket platform\u2019s mobile app for an electronic version of the ticket.","5":"Darya and friends could explore if the concert venue has a 'Will Call' option that would allow Ted to present his ID and receive a printed ticket onsite.","6":"R_5YJ9T5h1bEdxmwo"},"59":{"1":"Check if a soft copy or digital version of the ticket is available on Ted's email or phone that can be shown at the entrance.","2":"Contact the box office or customer service to see if they can issue a replacement ticket for Ted.","3":"Consider asking other friends or acquaintances already inside the venue if they have an extra ticket.","4":"See if it's possible to buy a new ticket at the venue, provided they are still available.","5":"Ask other attendees at the entrance if they have an extra ticket they're willing to sell or give away.","6":"R_5eRBvP0sxZai36F"},"60":{"1":"Contact the ticket office or customer service at the concert venue to see if they can reissue Ted's ticket based on his purchase confirmation.","2":"Explore digital options, such as seeing if Ted has an email confirmation of his ticket purchase that could be scanned at the entry.","3":"Look for a friend or acquaintance who may be arriving later to the concert but could bring Ted's ticket.","4":"Consider using a rideshare service for Ted to quickly travel to his house and back to minimize the time he would miss from the concert.","5":"Think about selling Ted's ticket through a reselling platform and buying a new ticket online for immediate digital delivery, if they are ava