nt.","2":"Contact the concert organizers or ticket booth to explain the situation and see if they can offer a solution such as reissuing the ticket.","3":"Consider buying an extra ticket on the spot if they are still available and if Ted can afford it.","4":"Ask around if anyone has a spare ticket that they would sell or give away.","5":"Offer to film or livestream selected parts of the concert for Ted to watch while he collects his ticket from home.","6":"R_6Nqe6RvYNY9JJxy"},"71":{"1":"Ask the ticket booth if they have a digital or replacement ticket option Ted can use.","2":"Call a cab or use a ride-share app to get Ted back to his house as quickly as possible to retrieve the ticket.","3":"See if any of the other group members have a spare ticket or if anyone nearby is selling a ticket.","4":"Check online to see if a last-minute ticket is available for purchase.","5":"Request the concert organizers or security if they can temporarily allow Ted inside while someone fetches the ticket for him.","6":"R_6NvLsQcfvpDDfKk"},"72":{"1":"Call the ticket provider or venue to inquire if they can reissue the ticket at the box office.","2":"Search for an electronic version of the ticket in Ted's email or on the ticket provider's website.","3":"Ask nearby attendees if they have an extra ticket they'd be willing to sell.","4":"Head to the venue's box office to see if they can provide assistance or issue a replacement ticket.","5":"Consider using a delivery service to retrieve the ticket from Ted's house if feasible and quick enough.","6":"R_6OW5jR2MDYdrBJa"},"73":{"1":"Suggest Ted to check if he has a digital copy of the ticket on his phone or email that he can show at the entrance.","2":"Call the ticketing office or customer service to see if they can reissue Ted's ticket at the box office.","3":"Ask the event managers at the entrance if they can allow Ted in with proof of purchase or ID.","4":"Consider buying a new ticket at the venue if there are any still available.","5":"Hav