can be shown at the entrance.","2":"Contact the box office and explain the situation, they may be able to reissue a ticket for Ted.","3":"Ask if any other friend has a spare ticket that Ted could use.","4":"Darya could offer to wait with Ted while he tries to find a solution to not leave him alone.","5":"As a last resort, consider purchasing a new ticket, if available and affordable, so Ted doesn't miss the concert.","6":"R_7IoVnw0ArQ3mBxU"},"99":{"1":"Darya could call the ticket office or customer service of the concert venue to see if they can reprint Ted's ticket or provide a digital copy.","2":"If Ted purchased the ticket online, Darya could ask him to check his email or the ticketing website for an electronic copy of the ticket.","3":"Darya and her friends could wait with Ted for a rideshare to return home quickly and retrieve his ticket.","4":"Darya could help Ted buy a new ticket at the box office, if available.","5":"If they entered with a group ticket, Darya could talk with the entrance control, explaining the situation to see if they could grant Ted access.","6":"R_7KHrBpnCr5f3dBu"},"100":{"1":"Suggest Ted to check if he has an electronic copy of the ticket on his email or on the concert's website.","2":"Contact the concert venue to see if they can reissue a ticket at the box office.","3":"Look for someone selling tickets outside the venue to see if Ted can buy an extra one.","4":"Leave the concert and accompany Ted to his house to collect the ticket for moral support.","5":"Ask other friends or acquaintances at the concert if they have an extra ticket Ted could use.","6":"R_7LoMJxBSqbzqZIb"},"101":{"1":"Suggest to Ted to check if there's a digital copy of his ticket available online which he can show at the entrance.","2":"Offer Ted to remain at the venue while the rest of the group attends the concert, ensuring he's not left alone.","3":"Propose calling the ticket office or customer service to explain the situation and see if they can arrange for a replacement ticket.","4":"Recommend Ted to ask around or post on social media to see if someone nearby has an extra ticket.","5":"Advise Ted to go back and retrieve his ticket if none of the other options work, and make plans to meet up at a specified time and place after the concert.","6":"R_7Mfhol7X5UPSa0F"},"102":{"1":"Ask the box office if there is any way to verify Ted's purchase and reissue his ticket.","2":"See if Ted can pull up his ticket confirmation on his phone and present a digital copy instead of a physical one.","3":"Check if the concert tickets have been sent through email and can be printed out at a nearby internet caf\u00e9 or at the concert venue.","4":"Consider having one member of the group wait outside for Ted as he returns home to retrieve his ticket.","5":"Explore nearby entertainment options that Ted could enjoy while the rest of the group attends the concert.","6":"R_7OqXkKYzlsjkL46"},"103":{"1":"Ask the ticket counter if there is a digital version of the ticket or if they could reprint the ticket based on identification and purchase proof.","2":"One of the friends could share their ticket with Ted, then the friend can go in first, and later, Ted can use the same ticket to go in.","3":"Check if any of the ticket reselling booths around the venue might still have available tickets for the concert, which Ted can buy.","4":"Take a cab or use a rideshare app to drive to Ted's house and retrieve the ticket as quickly as possible. In this case, Darya and\/or other friends could accompany Ted.","5":"If Ted has someone at his home, have them find the ticket, then take a picture or scan it and send it to Ted for use at the concert.","6":"R_7RPuNvoS1wImYhj"},"104":{"1":"Call the concert\u2019s customer service to explain the situation and see if there is a digital ticket or will call option.","2":"Suggest Ted to use the concert venue's app or website to see if a digital copy of his ticket is available.","3":"Offer to wait outside with Ted while others go inside the concert to keep him company as he solves the problem.","4":"Check with the groups of people around to see if anyone has an extra ticket they could sell or donate.","5":"Consider using a ride-hailing service for Ted to quickly pick up his ticket from home, while the rest of the group enjoys the concert.","6":"R_7RkxpXGygp7OzlL"},"105":{"1":"Ask if Ted has an electronic version of the ticket on his phone or email that he could use instead.","2":"See if it's possible to purchase a new ticket at the concert venue to avoid the delay of going back home.","3":"Check if the concert organizers have a lost-and-found or help desk where they could help sort out the situation.","4":"Offer to stay outside and wait with Ted to show solidarity and ensure that he isn't alone.","5":"Try to remember if any of their common friends that are already inside the concert could possibly have an extra ticket.","6":"R_7THjbDGkRTJW87D"},"106":{"1":"Ask if the venue can look up Ted's purchase on their system using his identification and let him in without a physical ticket.","2":"Try to purchase a new ticket at the entrance using a digital device, which would avoid the need to return to the house.","3":"Reach out to another friend or family member who could quickly fetch Ted's ticket from his house and deliver it to the concert venue.","4":"Find out if there is a digital copy of Ted's ticket in his email or on the ticket service's website, which could be shown to gain entry.","5":"Consider waiting for Ted if going back home to get his ticket won't make them miss the entire concert experience.","6":"R_7aQUXF1DpF85dxu"},"107":{"1":"Offer to call the concert's customer service to see if they could reissue a ticket for Ted at the box office.","2":"Suggest joining together to pay for another ticket for Ted, if financially feasible.","3":"Propose to wait for Ted and watch the concert later online or on a television channel if it\u2019s being broadcasted.","4":"Recommend that Ted uses ride-sharing services or a taxi to retrieve his ticket quickly to minimize missing the concert.","5":"Check if there are spare tickets being sold or given away at the venue by other concert-goers.","6":"R_7cuu3W19OmeXPkG"},"108":{"1":"Call the ticketing company or check their app to see if they can resend the ticket or provide a mobile version.","2":"Check if there are on-site ticket services at the concert location that might reissue the ticket.","3":"Consider asking other concert-goers or look online to see if anyone is selling an extra ticket at a reasonable price.","4":"Split into two groups, one stays with Ted while the other enters the concert, enabling later updates to Ted about the concert\u2019s progress.","5":"Ask the concert's customer service if there's any leeway for lost or forgotten tickets. People often forget tickets and there may be a protocol for this situation.","6":"R_7dYdOCptAEZUEbQ"},"109":{"1":"Contact the concert organizers to check if there is any electronic version of the ticket or any proof of purchase usable as a substitute.","2":"Ask the event staff if there is a lost-ticket counter where Ted can explain his situation and possibly get a replacement.","3":"Darya and the other friends can wait for a little while, delaying their entry until the issue is resolved.","4":"Offer to buy a fresh ticket from the counter or any potential resellers around if it is affordable.","5":"Darya can take a taxi, go fetch Ted's ticket, and return as fast as possible, depending on distance and time constraints.","6":"R_7dge1kF6uQj23Ll"},"110":{"1":"Offer to call the concert venue's box office to see if they can verify Ted's purchase and let him in without the physical ticket.","2":"Look up public transport or taxi options for Ted, in case he decides to go back home and retrieve the ticket.","3":"Suggest that Ted use a mobile version of the ticket if it's available, by checking the ticket vendor's website or app.","4":"Ask other friends or nearby concert-goers if anyone has an extra ticket they're willing to sell or give away.","5":"Consider missing the beginning of the concert and accompanying Ted back to his house to fetch the ticket to ensure he doesn't miss the entire event.","6":"R_7eQPp2GMyPdArG1"},"111":{"1":"Darya could ask Ted to check his email or ticket provider's app for a digital version of his ticket.","2":"In case they purchased the tickets together, Darya can present the bulk tickets if she has the copy.","3":"Darya can call the customer care service of the concert venue to explain the situation and ask for a possible solution.","4":"Offer to stay with Ted outside the concert while they try to convince security or management to let him in without the ticket.","5":"Ted can try to buy a new ticket at the venue if there are any left.","6":"R_7f9h58F8JOUjaj9"},"112":{"1":"Ask the ticket checker if they could look up Ted's purchase by his name or some other form of identification.","2":"Contact the concert venue's customer service to verify if they can resolve the issue or provide a duplicate ticket.","3":"Check if a digital copy of Ted's ticket was sent to his email, which he could use instead.","4":"Ask around to see if anyone is selling an extra ticket near the entrance.","5":"Consider waiting with Ted and watching the concert via a livestream, if available, until he can retrieve his ticket.","6":"R_7fvkgs3vBFEFpOV"},"113":{"1":"Contact the customer service of the concert organizers to see if they can reprint the ticket or provide a digital copy.","2":"Check to see if there's a ticket resale or exchange booth nearby, possibly Ted can purchase another ticket.","3":"Offer to lend Ted a phone and suggest that he calls someone who could pick up the ticket from his house and bring it to the venue.","4":"Ted could use a ride-share app to quickly return home and grab his ticket while the rest of the group enjoys the start of the concert.","5":"Ted might try speaking directly with security at the venue, to see if any accommodations can be made in his situation.","6":"R_7fxuBrEGNDgCclk"},"114":{"1":"Ask if the tickets were purchased online and if a digital copy could be shown at the entrance.","2":"Call the concert's customer service to explain the situation and ask if they could reissue a ticket at the box office.","3":"See if there is a public transportation option that could get Ted to his house and back more quickly than driving.","4":"Consider using a courier service or taxi to fetch the ticket from Ted's house.","5":"Ask other friends or family members who might be at Ted's house to bring the ticket.","6":"R_7jSYPB5dFNVGrZC"},"115":{"1":"Check if the ticket was bought online and whether there is a digital copy that could be shown at the entrance.","2":"Call the customer service of the concert and explain the situation to see if they can make an exception and allow Ted to enter without his ticket.","3":"Ask if any of their other friends who are at the concert have a spare ticket that Ted could use.","4":"Explore the possibility of buying another ticket at the entrance, if they are not sold out.","5":"Consider sending a cab or ride-sharing service to Ted's house to retrieve the ticket if possible.","6":"R_7lnp7fZJQqVaGzy"},"116":{"1":"Suggest Ted to check with the ticket office if they can access a digital version of his ticket by providing his ID or confirmation email.","2":"Propose that one of them waits outside with Ted while the rest attend the concert to keep him company.","3":"Explore the possibility of buying a new ticket on spot, if available.","4":"Consider calling a taxi or a close friend to bring Ted's ticket from his house to the concert venue.","5":"Check if the concert venue allows temporary exit and re-entry, which would allow one of the friends to retrieve the ticket while everyone else enjoys the beginning of the concert.","6":"R_7r7GMXlSKUxm3yN"}},"Randomization":"Subset","TotalRandSubset":1}}},"64":{"Type":"Standard","SubType":"","Description":"Scenario2","ID":"BL_ezYLb3879A4Ep7w","BlockElements":[{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID798"},{"Type":"Page Break"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID1016"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID799"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID800"},{"Type":"Page Break"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID992"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID807"},{"Type":"Page Break"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID801"},{"Type":"Page Break"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID802"},{"Type":"Page Break"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID803"},{"Type":"Page Break"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID804"},{"Type":"Page Break"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID805"},{"Type":"Page Break"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID806"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID1034"},{"Type":"Page Break"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID1003"},{"Type":"Page Break"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID949"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID950"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID951"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID952"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID953"}],"Options":{"BlockLocking":false,"RandomizeQuestions":"false","BlockVisibility":"Expanded","Looping":"Static","LoopingOptions":{"Static":{"1":{"1":"Contact roadside assistance service, like AAA, to request for an immediate car repair or tow on the highway.","2":"Call a taxi, Uber, or use a ride-hail app to get a ride to the airport immediately to ensure he doesn't miss his flight.","3":"Reach out to any friends or family who live nearby and could give him a ride to the airport.","4":"Inform the airline about his current predicament and see if the flight could be delayed or if there are subsequent flights he could take.","5":"Consider public transportation options, such as a nearby bus or train service if available and timings align with his flight schedule.","6":"R_10YuXEZMiRlBjOx"},"2":{"1":"Call for a taxi, Uber, or other ride-sharing services to get to the airport on time.","2":"Contact a roadside assistance service or call a tow truck to help with the car breakdown.","3":"Check if there's a nearby car rental service that available right away.","4":"Call the airport to see if the flight can be delayed or if they can get on the next available flight.","5":"Check if any public transportation routes, such as a bus or subway, go directly to the airport.","6":"R_1331xUhY5zy6gSR"},"3":{"1":"Immediately call for roadside assistance and inform them about his urgent travel situation.","2":"Order a taxi, Uber, or any other ride-sharing service to drive him to the airport.","3":"Contact the airline to inform them about his predicament and ask about possible solutions, such as a delayed flight.","4":"Put on the emergency flashers, get out of the car and try to ask for help from other drivers who may be able to give him a ride.","5":"Consider renting a car from a nearby service, if possible, and continue his journey to the airport.","6":"R_134cJb0TIqoRdMy"},"4":{"1":"Call for roadside assistance or a tow truck to help with his broken down vehicle so it does not remain a traffic hazard.","2":"Use a ride hailing app like Uber or Lyft to arrange for a quick pick-up to continue his journey to the airport.","3":"Consider contacting any nearby friends or family who might be able to give him a ride to the airport to avoid missing his flight.","4":"Inform the airline about his situation and seek advice on whether they can accommodate him on a later flight without any extra charges in case he misses his original flight.","5":"Take advantage of any airport shuttle services that might have stops near his location for a direct ride to the airport.","6":"R_1CIxBcS6977dG7H"},"5":{"1":"Call a car towing service for his broken down vehicle.","2":"Use a ride-hailing app like Uber or Lyft to arrange fast transport to the airport.","3":"Reach out to friends or family members who might be able to give him a quick ride to the airport.","4":"Check if there is a public transportation option, such as a bus or train, that could get him to the airport quickly.","5":"Call the airline to inform about his situation and ask if it's possible to be put on a later flight.","6":"R_1GCy5mc0Flrp14D"},"6":{"1":"Call a tow truck to take care of his car.","2":"Contact a taxi, ride-share service, or public transport to continue his journey to the airport.","3":"Inform the airline about the situation, asking if the flight could possibly be delayed.","4":"Reach out to friends or family who might be available to pick him up.","5":"Check if there are any nearby car rental services that could provide him a vehicle immediately.","6":"R_1H1Uw3bUXGuY5Qk"},"7":{"1":"Call for roadside assistance or a tow truck to handle the broken down car.","2":"Use a ride-sharing app or taxi service to quickly get transport to the airport.","3":"Reach out to a nearby friend or family member to provide a quick lift to the airport.","4":"Contact the airline to explain the situation and potentially reschedule the flight if necessary.","5":"Look for public transport options that might be feasible for reaching the airport.","6":"R_1JgUNzFk8pmHlLK"},"8":{"1":"Call a tow truck to remove his car from the highway.","2":"Phone for a taxi or a rideshare app like Uber or Lyft to take him to the airport immediately.","3":"Contact a friend or family member who might be able to pick him up and take him to the airport.","4":"Contact the airline to inform them of his situation and to inquire about possibly rescheduling his flight.","5":"Use a car rental app or service to rent a car for immediate pick-up if available nearby.","6":"R_1KP7DJG7oSLXN85"},"9":{"1":"Contact a roadside assistance service to get his car fixed or towed.","2":"Order a ride service like Uber or Lyft to take him to the airport.","3":"Call a friend or family member who could pick him up and drive him to the airport.","4":"Find a nearby public transportation route like a bus or train that could get him to the airport.","5":"Reach out to the airline to notify them of the situation and see if they can accommodate him on a later flight, if he fails to reach on time.","6":"R_1PsPUuPcckPaW0h"},"10":{"1":"Call a cab or request a ride via a ridesharing service such as Uber or Lyft to take him to the airport.","2":"Contact road assistance services to help with his broken car.","3":"Contact the airport and explain the situation to see if there are any possible later flights he could take.","4":"Hail a nearby taxi if one is going by, offering a tip for a fast trip to the airport.","5":"Ask a passing motorist for assistance, either to help fix the car or for a ride to the airport if they are heading in that direction.","6":"R_1UizpTuxmJPTPwJ"},"11":{"1":"Call a roadside assistance service to help with the car breakdown.","2":"Contact a taxi or ride-sharing service like Uber or Lyft to ensure he gets to the airport on time.","3":"Notify the airline about the situation to see if there are any options for late boarding or rebooking.","4":"Ask a friend or family member who lives nearby to drive him to the airport.","5":"Find a nearby public transport route, such as a bus or subway, that goes to the airport.","6":"R_1kjI7iAWjtWuBtD"},"12":{"1":"Call a tow truck service to remove the broken car from the road.","2":"Contact a taxi, Lyft, or Uber to quickly transport him to the airport.","3":"Reach out to a friend or family member nearby who could provide immediate transportation.","4":"Inform the airline about his situation to discuss possible options and see if there is a later flight he could take.","5":"Check nearby public transportation options like the subway or bus to the airport.","6":"R_1q9FXHr3KLkEuRA"},"13":{"1":"Call a roadside assistance service to either fix the car or tow it to a repair shop.","2":"Hail a taxi, or use a ride-hailing app, to get a quick ride to the airport.","3":"Contact the airline to inform them about his situation and inquire if a later flight if available.","4":"Reach out to a friend or family member living nearby to ask for assistance with transportation.","5":"Identify any nearby public transportation options, such as a train or a bus, that could feasibly get him to the airport on time.","6":"R_1xDXbFF1trhx9sZ"},"14":{"1":"Call a roadside assistance service to fix his car or tow it to a repair shop.","2":"Order an urgent taxi or rideshare service to get him to the airport quickly.","3":"Contact the airline to inform them about his situation and request a possible flight rescheduling.","4":"Reach out to anyone he knows who is nearby and could give him a lift.","5":"Consider utilizing public transportation services if they're available and can get him to the airport on time.","6":"R_1xRYt5vY4SBhvrh"},"15":{"1":"Call for emergency roadside assistance to fix the car, if time allows.","2":"Hail a taxi or use a ride-sharing application like Uber or Lyft to quickly get to the airport.","3":"Contact the airline to inform them of the situation and inquire about possible solutions or flight rescheduling.","4":"If other transport options are not available soon, consider hitchhiking or asking a passerby for help.","5":"Use public transportation if it's available and time allows, such as a bus or a metro.","6":"R_24672PSwk5P9b9q"},"16":{"1":"Call a roadside assistance service to address the car problem and facilitate transportation to the airport.","2":"Use a ride-sharing app like Uber or Lyft to get a quick ride to the airport.","3":"Contact a friend or family member who could provide immediate transport to the airport.","4":"Check if there is any public transportation nearby (like a metro station or bus stop) that could quickly get him to the airport.","5":"Contact the airline to explain the situation and see if they can put him on a later flight if he misses the current one.","6":"R_31vAmGcjZVljZKx"},"17":{"1":"Call a taxi or a ride-sharing service like Uber or Lyft to get him to the airport as fast as possible.","2":"Contact the local automobile association or car insurance company (if they offer roadside assistance) to help with the car breakdown.","3":"Inform the airline about the situation and inquire if there are any later flights he could take if he misses the current one.","4":"Check local public transportation options (bus or train) that could take him to the airports.","5":"If any friends or family live nearby, call them and ask for help, either to fix the vehicle or to provide a ride to the airport.","6":"R_32Kj2ZsL2wJkCMF"},"18":{"1":"Call a taxi, Uber, or other ride-share service to immediately transport him to the airport.","2":"Contact a roadside assistance service to fix the car, only if there is sufficient time before the flight.","3":"Reach out to a friend or family member who might be available to give him a ride to the airport.","4":"Check if there are public transportation options like a nearby bus or train that he could use to get to the airport.","5":"Contact the airline to notify about the situation and inquire about possible options if he misses his flight.","6":"R_35iqFeyE6Y3yoW5"},"19":{"1":"Call a taxi or use a ride-sharing app like Uber or Lyft to continue the journey to the airport.","2":"Contact a roadside assistance service to repair or tow his car.","3":"Ask a friend or family member to pick him up and drive him to the airport.","4":"Check if there's a bus or train station nearby that could provide transportation to the airport.","5":"Use a bike-rental or scooter-rental service, if available and feasible, to quickly get to the airport.","6":"R_37Wf6KQrV9KLE3L"},"20":{"1":"Call a tow truck to take care of his broken down car.","2":"Contact a ride-share service like Uber or Lyft to get to the airport on time.","3":"Reach out to a friend or family member who might be able to provide a quick ride.","4":"Inquire with nearby drivers or pedestrians about public transportation options to the airport.","5":"Consult with his travel agency or airline for potential solutions or to inform them about his situation.","6":"R_3GfUmAuEhJilobC"},"21":{"1":"Call a roadside assistance service to help with car repair, while also requesting an express service due to the flight urgency.","2":"Use a ride-share app like Uber or Lyft to get a quick ride to the airport, leaving the car by the road until his return.","3":"Contact the airline to inform them about the situation and investigate potential flight reschedule options.","4":"Flag down a taxi or look for a nearby public transportation option, like a bus or subway, that connects to the airport.","5":"Call a friend or family member living nearby to ask if they could quickly give him a lift to the airport.","6":"R_3Ka44xYsaccJsRl"},"22":{"1":"Call a roadside assistance service to diagnose and possibly repair the car problem.","2":"Contact a taxi or ride-share service to provide immediate transportation to the airport.","3":"Notify the airline of his situation to explore potential options for changing or delaying his flight.","4":"Solicit help from a friend or relative who might be able to drive him to the airport.","5":"Reach out to a nearby car rental service for a temporary vehicle to reach the airport on time.","6":"R_3Kd9wbbDeDakHvI"},"23":{"1":"Call a reliable roadside assistance service to help with the broken-down car.","2":"Use a ride-hailing service like Uber or Lyft to get to the airport as quickly as possible.","3":"Reach out to a friend or family member who can provide immediate transportation to the airport.","4":"Contact the airline to notify them of his situation and explore possible solutions, such as rescheduling the flight.","5":"Find a nearby public transportation route that leads to the airport, if this is a viable option.","6":"R_3L7egmbCS4CFSeZ"},"24":{"1":"Call a nearby emergency car repair service and request immediate help.","2":"Use a ride-share app like Uber or Lyft to arrange an immediate pickup and transportation to the airport.","3":"Call a friend or family member who might be able to quickly pick him up and drive him to the airport.","4":"Contact the airline, explain the situation, and inquire about the possibility of rescheduling the flight.","5":"Find the details for the nearest public transportation option, such as a bus or train, that could quickly get him to the airport.","6":"R_3LneE8eRBHnaDhm"},"25":{"1":"Call a roadside assistance service to report the broken car and request immediate help.","2":"Use a ride-hailing service like Uber or Lyft to arrange an immediate ride to the airport.","3":"Contact a friend or family member who might be able to provide a quick ride to the airport.","4":"Check nearby public transportation options (like bus or train lines) that could potentially take him to the airport.","5":"Call the airline to inform them about his situation and explore options for rescheduling the flight if necessary.","6":"R_3RTZTgG0o3PS9UW"},"26":{"1":"Contact a roadside assistance service to help with the car breakdown.","2":"Use a ride-hailing app like Uber or Lyft to get a quick ride to the airport.","3":"Call a taxi service for immediate transportation to the airport.","4":"Contact the airline to inform them about the situation and request if possible, a delayed departure or a switch to a later flight.","5":"Ask a friend or family member who lives nearby to give him a quick ride to the airport if they are available.","6":"R_3TRAtDsI23kW8xe"},"27":{"1":"Call a taxi or use a ride-hailing service like Uber or Lyft to get to the airport as quickly as possible.","2":"Contact a roadside assistance service to ask for help with his broken down car.","3":"Reach out to any nearby friends or family members who may be able to offer a quick ride to the airport.","4":"Consult a GPS or smartphone app to determine if there is public transportation available that could expedite his trip to the airport.","5":"Contact the airline to advise them of the situation and ask if there is any possibility of rescheduling the flight under the circumstances.","6":"R_3UPsQtUdY7cUC1r"},"28":{"1":"Call roadside assistance to report the car breakdown and request immediate help.","2":"While waiting for the roadside assistance, utilize a ride-hailing app like Uber or Lyft to request a ride to the airport.","3":"In the case of not having a ride-hailing app, call a taxi service to arrange for an immediate pickup.","4":"Contact the airport or airline to inform them of the situation and explore possible options such as flight rescheduling.","5":"In the worst-case scenario, flag down a passing vehicle for assistance, making sure to exercise caution and choose a safe location to do so.","6":"R_3dLmD9YHnrTxbYi"},"29":{"1":"Call a reliable ride-hailing service like Uber or Lyft to get to the airport as soon as possible.","2":"Contact the airplane company to inform them about the situation and possibly delay the flight if feasible.","3":"Find a nearby towing service to move the broken-down car out of the way and to fix it later.","4":"Contact friends or family living in the area for immediate assistance and a ride to the airport.","5":"Locate a nearby public transportation option, like a train or bus, that could potentially get him to the airport in time.","6":"R_3eabTgd20Ow0wGm"},"30":{"1":"Call for road assistance or a towing service to fix the car or take it to a garage.","2":"Use a taxi service, ride-sharing application, or public transportation to reach the airport.","3":"Contact the airline to inform them about his situation and explore options for rescheduling or getting on a later flight.","4":"Ask a friend or family member who lives nearby to drive him to the airport.","5":"Flag down a passing motorist and request their help or ask for a ride to the nearest airport shuttle station.","6":"R_3ewVtTkXFpJCoL4"},"31":{"1":"Call a tow truck to remove the broken down car from the highway.","2":"Use a ride-hailing app like Uber or Lyft to arrange for immediate transport to the airport.","3":"Contact the airline to inform them about the situation and inquire if there