lp fix the car quickly, if he has that option.","2":"Hail a taxi or use a ride-sharing service like Uber or Lyft to get to the airport.","3":"Contact the airline to inform them about his situation and request a later flight.","4":"Try to flag down a good Samaritan who might be able and willing to give a lift to the airport.","5":"Check for available public transportation options, like a bus or a train, that could reach the airport.","6":"R_71F6DXSC5gAMH5I"},"91":{"1":"Call a roadside assistance service or an auto repair shop nearby to attend to the car's breakdown.","2":"Contact a taxi service or use a ride-share app like Uber or Lyft to get a ride to the airport.","3":"Inform the airline of the situation and explore possibilities for rescheduling the flight without incurring any penalties or added costs.","4":"Seek help from a nearby pedestrian or motorist to assist with transportation to the airport or fixing the car, if it's a minor issue.","5":"Use public transportation, if available and viable, to get to the airport as quickly as possible.","6":"R_748gkENDxEQdCXn"},"92":{"1":"Use his phone to call for emergency roadside assistance to fix the car while he waits.","2":"Call a taxi, ride-sharing service, or friend to pick him up and take him to the airport.","3":"Check for nearby bus or train routes to the airport and use public transportation if possible.","4":"Wave down passing drivers and ask if they can offer a ride to the airport.","5":"Contact the airline to inform them about the situation and inquire about rescheduling the flight.","6":"R_79yrpyd3cXWMb4J"},"93":{"1":"Call a roadside assistance service like AAA to get his car towed.","2":"Use his phone to order a ride from a service like Uber or Lyft to the airport.","3":"Call a friend or family member who lives nearby to pick him up and bring him to the airport.","4":"Flag down a passing taxi or shuttle service to take him to the airport.","5":"Contact the airline to let them know he might be late and to ask about possible later flights he could take if he misses his original one.","6":"R_7CdlOs0JzrLKojT"},"94":{"1":"Call for roadside assistance to fix the car if time allows.","2":"Call a taxi, rideshare service, or use a public transport if available to get to the airport.","3":"Call the airport's airline attendant to inform about the situation and inquire about possible flight delays or rescheduling options.","4":"Contact a nearby friend or family member and ask for a ride to the airport.","5":"Consider finding a nearby car rental service to reach the airport on time.","6":"R_7E6qycPAnfTED9I"},"95":{"1":"Call for road assistance to fix the car as soon as possible.","2":"Order a ride from a reliable taxi service or ride-sharing app to proceed to the airport while the car is being fixed.","3":"Contact someone he knows who lives nearby and ask for a ride to the airport.","4":"Contact the airline to inform them about his situation and inquire about possible options for rescheduling his flight.","5":"Look for public transportation options that could get him to the airport if other options are unavailable or impractical.","6":"R_7INuqY1rcsugVU9"},"96":{"1":"Call roadside assistance or a local mechanic to quickly deal with the car breakdown.","2":"Flag down a passing car with a request to take him to the nearest public transportation or taxi station.","3":"Use a ridesharing app like Uber or Lyft to immediately arrange a ride to the airport.","4":"Contact the airline to inform about the situation and inquire if it's possible to get on a subsequent flight if he were to miss the current one.","5":"Look for nearby car rental services on his mobile map, rent a car and drive to the airport.","6":"R_7IXVwKHjO3yC5VF"},"97":{"1":"Call for a roadside assistance service to get the car fixed or towed.","2":"Get out of the car and try to hail a taxi or get a ride from a passing vehicle.","3":"Use a smartphone to book a ride from a ride-hailing service like Uber or Lyft.","4":"Contact t