rport.","3":"Reach out to a friend or family member who could quickly give him a lift to the airport.","4":"Inform the airline about the situation to see if there's possibility for a later flight.","5":"Check the luggage and necessary travel documents are ready for the quick transition from car to the alternate mode of transport.","6":"R_7fSMCxP1Mg54E8p"},"105":{"1":"Call for roadside assistance to fix the car or tow it.","2":"Use a ride-hailing app such as Uber or Lyft to get a quick ride to the airport.","3":"Call a taxi service for immediate assistance to get to the airport.","4":"Flag down a nearby car and ask for a lift to the airport.","5":"Check for the availability of any nearby public transportation, such as a train or bus, that goes to the airport.","6":"R_7fvkgs3vBFEFpOV"},"106":{"1":"Call a towing service to have his car removed from the highway.","2":"Use a rideshare app like Uber or Lyft to quickly secure transportation to the airport.","3":"Contact the airline to inform them about the situation and explore the possibility of rescheduling his flight.","4":"Reach out to a friend or family member who might be able to help him get to the airport in time.","5":"Consider public transportation options, like buses or trains, that could get him to the airport.","6":"R_7fxuBrEGNDgCclk"},"107":{"1":"Call a taxi or an Uber to pick him up and bring him to the airport.","2":"Contact the airport to inform them about his situation and ask about the possibility of delaying the flight.","3":"Call a roadside assistance service like AAA to get his car repaired as quickly as possible.","4":"Contact a friend or family member who may be able to give him a lift to the airport.","5":"Look for public transportation options that could take him to the airport.","6":"R_7h8mYdopwD4RSHn"},"108":{"1":"Call for roadside assistance to get the car repaired as fast as possible.","2":"Consider using a ride-sharing app like Uber or Lyft to quickly arrange transport to the airport.","3":"Flag down a taxi if one passes by, explaining the urgency of the situation.","4":"Check if there is any public transport like a bus or railway that can get him close to the airport.","5":"Contact any friends or family who might be able to provide a quick ride to the airport.","6":"R_7mJkSFegDSIFZtg"},"109":{"1":"Call a roadside assistance service to fix his car or tow it to a nearby service station.","2":"Hail a cab, use a rideshare app like Uber or Lyft, or use public transportation if available to continue his journey to the airport.","3":"Contact the airline to inquire about the possibility of rescheduling his flight due to his unexpected car trouble.","4":"Check with nearby hotels or car rental agencies for potential temporary transportation solutions.","5":"Reach out to a friend or family member who can immediately help him reach the airport.","6":"R_7q27kBo2mFOFeF3"},"110":{"1":"Call a reliable towing or roadside assistance service to handle his broken car.","2":"Book a taxi, Uber, or other ride-share service to continue his trip to the airport.","3":"Contact the airport or airline to inform them of his situation and inquire about possible flight delays or rescheduling options.","4":"Seek help from a nearby pedestrian or fellow motorist to get to the nearest public transport station.","5":"Check if there are any car rental services nearby where he could rent a vehicle to continue his journey.","6":"R_7ruqhY3TaeynaIp"},"111":{"1":"Call a taxi or use a ride-share app to get to the airport quickly.","2":"Contact road assistance for help with the broken car.","3":"Alert the airlines about his situation to see if there is any leeway or a later flight he can catch instead.","4":"Check with the nearby public transportation options that could possibly lead to the airport.","5":"Look for luggage-friendly hotels nearby where he can stay and catch a flight the next day.","6":"R_7uQq9IlFDf6Cifn"},"112":{"1":"Call a roadside assistance service immediately to help with the car breakdown.","2":"Use his phone to request a taxi, rideshare service, or use public transit to get to the airport as soon as possible.","3":"Contact the airline to inform them about the situation, they might be able to advise on what to do or potentially reschedule his flight.","4":"Reach out to a friend or family member nearby who might be able to give him a lift to the airport.","5":"In case of remaining stuck, look for nearby hotels or accommodations to rest and reschedule his journey.","6":"R_7wcxPZnxatAQoKd"},"113":{"1":"Call a roadside assistance service immediately to get his car fixed or towed.","2":"Hail a taxi or use a ride-sharing app to continue his trip to the airport.","3":"Contact the airlines to inform them about his situation and explore options for rescheduling or delaying his flight.","4":"Reach out to a friend or family member who lives nearby to see if they can give him a ride to the airport.","5":"Look for nearby public transportation options like a bus or subway that could take him to the airport.","6":"R_8Fao0B8LFtkdzCk"}},"Randomization":"Subset","TotalRandSubset":1}}},"65":{"Type":"Standard","SubType":"","Description":"Scenario4","ID":"BL_3k5uDKWYt2jSYt0","BlockElements":[{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID808"},{"Type":"Page Break"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID1018"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID809"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID810"},{"Type":"Page Break"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID994"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID817"},{"Type":"Page Break"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID811"},{"Type":"Page Break"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID812"},{"Type":"Page Break"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID813"},{"Type":"Page Break"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID814"},{"Type":"Page Break"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID815"},{"Type":"Page Break"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID816"},{"Type":"Page Break"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID1036"},{"Type":"Page Break"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID1005"},{"Type":"Page Break"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID959"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID960"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID961"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID962"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID963"}],"Options":{"BlockLocking":false,"RandomizeQuestions":"false","BlockVisibility":"Expanded","Looping":"Static","LoopingOptions":{"Static":{"1":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the suspected drunk driver to avoid sudden erratic maneuvers.","2":"Identify identifying details of the car like the color, make\/model, and license plate number for future reference.","3":"Contact local law enforcement, providing the car's description and location to report the suspected drunk driving.","4":"Use a hands-free device to call, ensuring Eamon maintains full control of his own vehicle while on the phone.","5":"Look for a safe way to pass the car if possible and legal, to prevent being involved in a potential accident.","6":"R_1331xUhY5zy6gSR"},"2":{"1":"Eamon could safely maintain distance from the suspected intoxicated driver to avoid any abrupt collisions.","2":"If possible, Eamon can find a safe opportunity to overtake the car and prevent himself from being directly behind the unpredictable driver.","3":"Eamon can record the car's license plate number and description for identification purposes.","4":"Eamon could call the local non-emergency line to report the driver, providing them with the details he observed and the car's whereabouts.","5":"Consider pulling over to a safe area and waiting until the suspected intoxicated driver is far ahead.","6":"R_137y6DOU2tvccCp"},"3":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the suspected intoxicated driver to avoid any sudden erratic moves they might make.","2":"Record the car's license plate, make, and model, if it's safe to do so.","3":"If possible, pull over and make a call to the local non-emergency police hotline, providing them with details about the driver's behavior and car information.","4":"Avoid trying to overtake the potentially intoxicated driver, as this could lead to unsafe conditions.","5":"If the driver shows extreme erratic behavior, such as rapid acceleration or deceleration, consider pulling over and waiting for them to move far ahead before continuing your journey.","6":"R_14HOA7OpsxxMkV8"},"4":{"1":"Stay a safe distance behind the potentially intoxicated driver to avoid any potential accidents or sudden stops.","2":"Turn on his hazard lights to alert other drivers of the potential danger on the road.","3":"Call local law enforcement to report the driver, providing a description of the car, the driver's behavior, and the car's current location.","4":"Be prepared to pull off the road or take evasive action if the other driver's behavior becomes even more erratic.","5":"If possible, note the vehicle's license plate number for sharing with the police.","6":"R_172SUVOzbqsydYm"},"5":{"1":"Eamon could maintain a safe distance from the suspected drunken driver to avoid any sudden crashes.","2":"He can take note of the car's license plate number, make, model, and color for reporting purposes.","3":"He can alert the local police or traffic authority about the erratic driver, providing the vehicle's details and the particular road they are on.","4":"Eamon could try to overtake the car when it is safe, ensuring he does not get into an accident with the unpredictable car.","5":"He might use his car's horn or high-beam lights to alert the driver ahead, possibly getting him to correct his driving. However, this is risky as it might startle the driver into making a mistake.","6":"R_186igmeqA8uoA3D"},"6":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the vehicle to protect himself from unpredicted movements.","2":"Call the police and provide the necessary details including the vehicle\u2019s model and license plate.","3":"Attempt to safely overtake the other vehicle if the road is clear, but avoid direct confrontation with the suspected intoxicated driver.","4":"Follow the car from a safe distance and act as a guide for police when they arrive.","5":"Inform other motorists by honking or flashing lights from a safe distance, if possible and without endangering himself or others.","6":"R_18J7rCWLhtX6q6T"},"7":{"1":"Follow the car at a safe distance to avoid any sudden and unpredictable moves from the suspected intoxicated driver.","2":"Contact local law enforcement by dialing non-emergency number or 911 to report the erratic driving behavior and provide them with the car's description and license plate number.","3":"Record the behavior if it is safe to do so. This can provide evidence to law enforcement officials.","4":"Avoid attempting to pass the car since the driver's actions are unpredictable and it could result in a collision.","5":"Warn other drivers if possible by flashing headlights or using the car horn. This could alert them to the potential danger on the road.","6":"R_19cNfbgg5OrCi7n"},"8":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the potentially intoxicated driver to avoid any accidents.","2":"Take note of the car's make, model, color and license plate number if possible.","3":"Call the local non-emergency number or highway patrol to report a potentially intoxicated driver, providing the details noticed.","4":"If necessary and safe, pull over to the side of the road to make the call and let the suspected intoxicated driver get farther ahead.","5":"Look for an alternate route to home to avoid sharing the road with the potentially dangerous driver.","6":"R_1B3yUYDk0ATzOrL"},"9":{"1":"Slow down and maintain a safe distance from the suspected impaired driver to avoid a potential accident.","2":"Call local law enforcement or a non-emergency police number to report the erratic driver, providing a description of the vehicle and its location.","3":"Film or record the driver's behavior, if it is safe to do so, to provide evidence to the police.","4":"Try to obtain the car's license plate number to give to the police. Ensure this is done without risking safety.","5":"Consider taking an alternative route to avoid interaction with the potential dangerous driver.","6":"R_1CIxBcS6977dG7H"},"10":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the suspected drunk driver to avoid any sudden move they might make.","2":"Attempt to get a clear view of the car's license plate number without compromising his safety.","3":"If possible, pull over to the side of the road and let the driver proceed without causing danger to himself.","4":"Contact local law enforcement to report the driver providing them with the location and a description of the vehicle.","5":"Look for a well-lit, populated area to stop and make the call if pulling over immediately isn't safe or feasible.","6":"R_1FoMVTIovcMTXJT"},"11":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the vehicle to avoid any sudden and unexpected movements.","2":"Observe the driver's behavior more carefully to confirm suspicions, noting behaviors such as repeated drifting across lane markers and irregular or sudden braking.","3":"Record the vehicle's details, such as the make, model, color, and license plate number if possible, all while maintaining a safe distance.","4":"Contact local law enforcement to report the suspected drunk driver, providing them with the gathered details and the current location.","5":"Avoid trying to overtake or confront the suspected drunk driver, as this could potentially put Eamon or other drivers in danger.","6":"R_1HFyhmUlf2ySZsk"},"12":{"1":"Eamon can maintain a safe distance from the suspected intoxicated driver to avoid any sudden mishaps.","2":"He can take note of the vehicle's license plate and car make or model.","3":"Eamon should contact local law enforcement and report the situation, providing them with the details he has noted.","4":"If possible and safe, Eamon could take a different route home to avoid being directly behind the possibly intoxicated driver.","5":"He can warn other drivers by flashing his lights or honking the horn, but he should do so while maintaining a safe driving behavior.","6":"R_1HZxyJlH62RJoLD"},"13":{"1":"Keep a safe distance from the erratic driver to avoid potential collisions.","2":"Attempt to memorize the intoxicated driver's license plate in case a report needs to be filed.","3":"If possible, pull off the road and call the local authorities to report the suspected intoxicated driver.","4":"Make a note of the car make, model, and color for ease in identification by the police.","5":"Do not attempt to pass the erratic driver if it seems dangerous or potentially life-threatening.","6":"R_1Oq2aa0rEDoAdRB"},"14":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the vehicle to avoid any potential crashes caused by the driver's erratic behavior.","2":"Memorize or take a picture (if it is safe to do so) of the vehicle's make, model, and license plate number.","3":"Pull over to a safe area if the driving becomes extremely erratic or dangerous, and let the vehicle pass.","4":"Call the local non-emergency police line or use a designated hotline to report suspected drunk driving, providing details on the vehicle and the driver's behavior.","5":"Follow the directions given by the police or emergency operator, continuing to observe the vehicle's movements without engaging or confronting the driver directly.","6":"R_1Py1Y1UUqvsIWvD"},"15":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the suspected intoxicated driver, increasing the usual following distance to avoid any sudden or unpredictable maneuvers.","2":"Contact local authorities, such as the police, to report the suspected intoxicated driver, providing the make, model, and license plate number if possible, along with the current location and direction.","3":"Take alternative routes to avoid being behind the suspected intoxicated driver, ensuring personal safety.","4":"Capture the erratic movement of the suspected intoxicated driver's car using a dashcam or other device, should this prove necessary for potential legal proceedings.","5":"Stay calm and focused on the road, keeping an eye on any other vehicles that may also be affected by the suspected intoxicated driver's actions.","6":"R_1V3zySB3UIYJbHE"},"16":{"1":"Create enough distance between his car and the vehicle ahead, maintaining a safe distance in case the car swerves unpredictably.","2":"Attentively monitor the erratic driver's behavior to anticipate any abrupt changes in their movement.","3":"Get the license plate number and the car description to report to the authorities.","4":"If possible, find a safe place to pull over and call local law enforcement to report the suspected drunk driver.","5":"Avoid trying to pass the vehicle or get the driver's attention on his own, as it may escalate the situation or put him in danger.","6":"R_1WYzGZ0XsipotZ6"},"17":{"1":"Keep a safe distance to prevent any potential accidents due to the erratic behavior of the suspected intoxicated driver.","2":"Contact the local police department and share the description and license plate of the car driving erratically.","3":"Pull over to the side of the road and let the potentially intoxicated driver pass to avoid being near the erratic driving.","4":"Turn on hazard lights or flash headlights to warn other drivers about the potentially hazardous driver ahead.","5":"Monitor the erratic vehicle from a safe distance while waiting for law enforcement to respond.","6":"R_1XhTh0kIcdAJQOI"},"18":{"1":"Slow down to keep a safe distance from the suspected intoxicated driver.","2":"Call the local authorities or a highway patrol number, providing them with the vehicle's description and location.","3":"Avoid overtaking the suspected intoxicated driver, unless it's absolutely safe to do so.","4":"Turn on hazard lights to alert other drivers to the potential danger ahead.","5":"If possible without endangering himself, Eamon could record the erratic driving behavior as evidence for police.","6":"R_1ZkmnFe2xKTk50J"},"19":{"1":"Call the local police or highway patrol to report the suspected drunk driver, providing as many details as possible, such as the car's make, model, color, and license plate number, and the driver's behavior.","2":"Maintain a safe distance from the suspected drunk driver to avoid a collision in case they make a sudden or erratic move.","3":"Avoid attempting to pass the suspected drunk driver, as this could create a more dangerous situation.","4":"Use his vehicle\u2019s high beams and\/or horn in an attempt to alert the driver of their erratic driving.","5":"Attempt to capture a video or photographic evidence of the erratic driving if it can be done without compromising his own safety or violating local laws.","6":"R_1d1sQwl1ukvRluN"},"20":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the potentially intoxicated driver to avoid an accident.","2":"Record the vehicle's license plate number and any other distinguishing features.","3":"Call the local police or highway patrol and report the erratic driving, giving them the details of the vehicle and its location.","4":"If there's a safe opportunity and it's allowed in your area, carefully overtake the vehicle to avoid a potential accident.","5":"Be alert and prepared for unpredictable movements from the possibly intoxicated driver.","6":"R_1eqcFrAmkqAdeyz"},"21":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the erratic driver to prevent potential collisions.","2":"Record the license plate, vehicle description, and the driver's behavior to report to the authorities.","3":"Call the local police or highway patrol to notify them about the possibly intoxicated driver.","4":"Avoid overtaking or getting too close to the car to ensure personal safety.","5":"Flash his car's headlights or honk the horn in a non-confrontational way, hoping to alert the driver to their dangerous behavior.","6":"R_1mPDnXYAvuYpPfH"},"22":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the suspected intoxicated driver to avoid any sudden accidents.","2":"Observe the vehicle's driving pattern for a little longer to confirm if the driver really is intoxicated.","3":"If Eamon has a passenger, ask them to record the erratic behavior of the car as evidence.","4":"Contact local law enforcement and supply them with the information, including car model, color, and license plate number.","5":"Look for a safe spot to pull over and let the suspected intoxicated driver pass, to avoid potential dangers.","6":"R_1oHisKPtBvOxEoi"},"23":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the suspected intoxicated driver to avoid any potential accidents.","2":"Attempt to record their license plate number, vehicle description, and erratic driving behavior details without endangering his own safety.","3":"Pull over to a safe location and call the local authorities to report the suspected intoxicated driver, providing all the detailed information he has observed.","4":"If possible, turn on hazard lights or flash headlights intermittently as a signal to alert other drivers about the possible danger on the road.","5":"If the driver's behavior continues to be a danger and he is in an area with poor cell service, he can drive to a nearby populated area or a police station to report the situation in person.","6":"R_24672PSwk5P9b9q"},"24":{"1":"Eamon could maintain a safe distance from the other vehicle to avoid any sudden or unexpected moves the driver might make.","2":"He could take down the vehicle's license plate number, make, and model for future reference.","3":"He could pull over at a safe location and call the non-emergency police line to report the erratic driver, providing all the information he gathered.","4":"He should avoid attempting to overtake the suspected drunk driver, as this could potentially result in an accident.","5":"If possible and safe, Eamon could record the erratic driving behavior of the individual to provide additional evidence when reporting the incident.","6":"R_31vAmGcjZVljZKx"},"25":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the suspected intoxicated driver to avoid any sudden moves they may make.","2":"Look for opportunities to safely pass the suspected intoxicated driver, only doing so when there is a clear view of the opposing traffic and it is legal to do so.","3":"Capture the license plate number, car model, and any other identifiable information about the suspected intoxicated driver.","4":"Report the situation to the local police over a hands-free device, providing them with the car's description and location.","5":"Stop following the suspect and pull over safely if the driver's behavior becomes overly dangerous or if instructed to do so by the police.","6":"R_34614PuzRY0GGWo"},"26":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the car ahead to avoid any unexpected and sudden movements.","2":"Alert the local police by dialing the non-emergency line to report a potentially intoxicated driver, providing the location and a description of the car.","3":"Use his car's dash camera, if available, to record the erratic behavior of the vehicle ahead for evidence.","4":"If safe and legal, attempt to overtake the car when there are no oncoming vehicles in the other lane.","5":"Flash his headlights or honk his horn cautiously to alert the suspected intoxicated driver about their erratic driving.","6":"R_36onj2b4AkPb94t"},"27":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the potentially intoxicated driver to avoid any unpredictable actions.","2":"Attempt to capture the car's license plate number without compromising his own safety.","3":"If Eamon feels it is safe and legal, he could overtake the car to avoid any possible collision.","4":"Call the local authorities and provide them with the car's description along with its erratic behavior.","5":"Avoid any form of confrontation or trying to stop the suspected drunken driver himself. It's best to let the professionals handle such a delicate situation.","6":"R_38wwGlE6U0dFjbj"},"28":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the suspected intoxicated driver to avoid a potential accident.","2":"Attempt to capture the vehicle's license plate number if it's safe to do so.","3":"Call local law enforcement, giving them a description of the car and its erratic behavior, along with its current location.","4":"If possible and safe, pull over to the side of the road to let the erratic driver get farther away.","5":"Turn on hazard lights or flash headlights to warn other drivers about the potential danger on the road.","6":"R_390lu0Gj35K6IXD"},"29":{"1":"Create a safe distance between his vehicle and the suspected drunk driver's car.","2":"Consider pulling over to the side of the road and allow the suspicious driver to get farther ahead.","3":"Attempt to capture the license plate number of the erratic car discretely and safely.","4":"Contact local law enforcement authorities to report the driver, providing as much details as possible such as the car type, color, and license plate number.","5":"Stay vigilant and watch for potential unpredictable moves from the suspected intoxicated driver.","6":"R_3FLoTbiexdyTjFe"},"30":{"1":"Maintain a safe following distance from the suspected intoxicated driver while observing his driving pattern.","2":"Call local authorities to report the suspected drunk driver, providing them with the car's make, model, color, and license plate number if possible.","3":"Record the driver's erratic behavior using a dashcam if Eamon has one installed in his vehicle.","4":"Flash his lights and sound his horn to alert the driver that his driving is dangerous and to caution other drivers about the situation.","5":"If possible, Eamon should take an alternative route to avoid the potential risks posed by the intoxicated driver.","6":"R_3HwH8kiDPM0K5I5"},"31":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the suspected intoxicated driver to avoid any unexpected maneuvers.","2":"Attempt to safely pass the car if possible and as long as it doesn't break traffic rules.","3":"Memorize or take note of the car\u2019s make, model, color, and license plate number while keeping a safe distance.","4":"Call the local law enforcement or highwa