iver by providing important details such as the car's model, color, and license plate number.","3":"Record the erratic driving behavior with dash-cam if available as evidence.","4":"Avoid attempting to pass the erratic driver if the traffic condition is not safe.","5":"Activate his car's hazards to signal other drivers about the potential danger.","6":"R_6N4bFWdLy2Tcs4F"},"70":{"1":"Keep a safe distance from the vehicle ahead to avoid any sudden or unpredictable movements from the suspected drunken driver.","2":"Try to capture the vehicle's license plate number and description without endangering his own safety.","3":"Call the local law enforcement non-emergency number to report the behavior and provide the details he has gathered.","4":"Alert other drivers on the road by flashing his lights or honking his horn, if it can be done without causing panic or confusion.","5":"Avoid attempting to overtake the vehicle on the potentially risky two-lane road.","6":"R_6Q3PxgSRCeRwVFL"},"71":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the suspected drunk driver to avoid potential accidents.","2":"Turn on vehicle's dashboard camera, if available, to record the erratic driving behavior.","3":"Make a note of the vehicle's make, model, color, and license plate number for reporting purposes.","4":"Contact local law enforcement or highway patrol to report the suspected drunk driver, providing all the details noticed.","5":"Follow law enforcement's instructions, which may include staying on the line or continuing to follow the vehicle at a safe distance, until they arrive.","6":"R_6R47P5pW4SvPuQI"},"72":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the suspected vehicle to avoid potential accidents.","2":"Try to memorize the license plate number, vehicle model and color to provide to authorities if necessary.","3":"Pull over to the side of the road and dial the local non-emergency police number to report the potentially dangerous driver.","4":"Avoid attempting to overtake or confront the suspected intoxicated driver as this could lead to a dangerous situation.","5":"Activate dashboard camera, if available, to capture the driver's behavior as evidence.","6":"R_6ZddgAvFMr0B6PD"},"73":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the car in question to avoid any potential accidents.","2":"Signal or honk at the driver to alert him of his erratic driving.","3":"Pull over to the side of the road, and once it's safe, continue driving.","4":"Call the local authorities and provide details of the driver's behavior and car description.","5":"Stay alert and prepared to take evasive action if the car continues to swerve unpredictably.","6":"R_6dA6wMK0DjMeiNW"},"74":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the suspected intoxicated driver to avoid any potential accidents.","2":"Take note of the car's make, model, color, and if possible, the license plate number.","3":"Call the local non-emergency police number to report the suspected drunk driver, giving them the details about the car and the observed behavior.","4":"If possible and safe, pull over to the side of the road to allow the erratic driver to get further ahead.","5":"Look for alternative routes home to avoid sharing the road with the potentially dangerous driver.","6":"R_6eJmL4gP3l9LMhC"},"75":{"1":"Keep a safe distance from the suspected intoxicated driver to avoid any potential accident.","2":"Try to observe the license plate number and the make and model of the car. This information could be useful if a report is to be made to the police.","3":"Look for an opportunity to safely overtake the potentially intoxicated driver if the road and traffic conditions allow it.","4":"Consider pulling over and calling the local law enforcement to report the person's erratic driving.","5":"Use a hands-free device to report the situation immediately to the non-emergency police number if available and safe to do while driving.","6":"R_6frFqDy52Bhhfvm"},"76":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the potentially intoxicated driver to avoid an accident.","2":"Attempt to get the license plate number of the erratic driver's car for report purposes.","3":"Pull over to a safe location and call the local authorities to report the driver.","4":"Provide a detailed description of the car's make, model, color, and any other distinguishing features to the authorities.","5":"If a safe opportunity arises, try to pass the potentially intoxicated driver. However, be extremely cautious and only execute this action if sure it does not risk a collision or put others in danger.","6":"R_6hMwcozWtrIlmPi"},"77":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the suspected intoxicated driver to avoid any potential erratic movements.","2":"Take note of the vehicle's make, model, color, and license plate number for reference.","3":"Call the local non-emergency police number, describe the situation including the car details, and follow their instructions.","4":"If the situation seems increasingly dangerous or the driver starts posing a direct threat to others, dial emergency services immediately.","5":"Look for alternate routes or safely pull over and stop if possible, until the suspected intoxicated driver has moved on.","6":"R_6ngZTn7G3I4XIOt"},"78":{"1":"Call the police and provide them with the vehicle's description and location.","2":"If possible, obtain the license plate number of the suspect vehicle to supply to police.","3":"Maintain a safe distance from the vehicle to avoid any potential accidents.","4":"Avoid attempting to pass the vehicle unless it's completely safe to do so.","5":"Warn other drivers by flashing lights or honking if it is safe and legal.","6":"R_6pYEdL33fQLsjZA"},"79":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the suspected intoxicated driver to avoid a potential collision.","2":"Call local law enforcement or a non-emergency number to report the situation and provide details about the car and driver.","3":"If possible, capture the license plate number and car model without compromising his own safety.","4":"Alert other drivers by flashing his headlights or using his car's horn, if it's safe to do so.","5":"Avoid overtaking or engaging the suspected intoxicated driver directly to minimize the risk of an accident.","6":"R_6qxGGD8qawMhIVR"},"80":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the erratically moving vehicle to avoid a potential accident.","2":"Observe any other unusual driving behaviors, such as erratic changes in speed, not using turn signals, or failure to stop at traffic signs.","3":"Record the license plate number, car model, color, and any distinguishing features of the vehicle.","4":"Contact local police or highway patrol to report the incident, providing them with the information collected.","5":"Follow the suspected intoxicated driver at a safe distance until law enforcement arrives, only if it doesn't endanger his own safety.","6":"R_6r1CHxmVmpZKwDu"},"81":{"1":"Keep a safe distance from the suspected intoxicating driver to avoid any possible sudden moves.","2":"Dial the local non-emergency police number or 911 to report the erratic driving, detailing the location, direction, car make and model, and color.","3":"Activate dashcam if available in the car to record the suspected intoxicated driver's behavior as evidence.","4":"Avoid attempting to overtake or get the driver's attention, as this may lead to unpredictable responses.","5":"Alert other drivers by honking the horn or flashing the car's lights, if it can be done safely.","6":"R_6vk1w0Mnt22ruO5"},"82":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the suspected intoxicated driver to avoid collision in case of erratic movements.","2":"Attempt to note down the license plate number, car model, and color of the vehicle for reporting purposes.","3":"Do not attempt to overtake the potentially intoxicated driver, as his movements are unpredictable.","4":"Call the local non-emergency police number to report the suspected intoxicated driver, providing them with all pertinent information.","5":"If passing through populated areas, horn repeatedly to alert other drivers and pedestrians about the potential risk.","6":"R_6xSIAt6QWgAQCVb"},"83":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the erratic vehicle to prevent a potential accident.","2":"Try to note down the vehicle's number plate for identification if possible and safe to do so.","3":"Avoid attempting to pass the vehicle unless there is extensive visibility and it is safe to do so.","4":"Dial the local non-emergency police number to report the erratic behavior and provide any identifying characteristics of the vehicle.","5":"Alert other road users if possible, by flashing headlights or honking briefly.","6":"R_6z8cuIi7ilCUtQI"},"84":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the suspected intoxicated driver to avoid any potential accidents.","2":"Attempt to get the car's license plate number, make, and model for reporting purposes.","3":"Pull over at a safe location and call the local police or highway patrol to report the suspected intoxicated driver, providing them with as much detail as possible.","4":"If there are passengers in his car, ensure they are wearing their seat belts to be prepared for any unexpected maneuvers.","5":"Consider taking an alternate route to ensure his own safety, if possible.","6":"R_71cmNR3xwC4Wyn6"},"85":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the potentially intoxicated driver to avoid any sudden maneuvers they might make.","2":"Call local law enforcement and report the erratic behavior, giving them as many details as possible, such as vehicle color, make, model, and license plate number.","3":"If possible, pull over to the side of the road to let the potentially intoxicated driver move further ahead, reducing the risk of a collision.","4":"Record the erratic driving with his phone or car dashcam, making sure to stay focused on the road while doing so.","5":"Avoid attempting to pass the potentially intoxicated driver unless it is absolutely necessary or advised by law enforcement.","6":"R_731vnMKEFbM9Mx3"},"86":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the car in question to avoid an accident if they swerve unexpectedly.","2":"Prepare to take evasive action if necessary, such as pulling off to the side of the road.","3":"Record the license plate number, car model, and any other distinguishable features for identification.","4":"Call the local non-emergency police number to report the suspected drunk driver, giving them the information you gathered.","5":"If feasible and safe, follow the car at a distance until the police arrive, providing the dispatcher with updates.","6":"R_74ocetsavJcSRWM"},"87":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the erratic driver to prevent collision.","2":"Attempt to alert the driver by using headlights or the car horn, if it is safe to do so.","3":"Immediately note down important details such as the car model, color, and license plate number for reporting.","4":"Find a safe place to pull over and call local law enforcement or non-emergency police number to report the driver.","5":"Record video evidence of the erratic driving if it's safe to do so, which can strengthen the report to law enforcement.","6":"R_7E6qycPAnfTED9I"},"88":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the suspected intoxicated driver to avoid a potential collision.","2":"Record the car's license plate number and features for reporting purposes.","3":"Contact the local authorities to alert them about the potentially intoxicated driver on the road.","4":"Signal or flash headlights at the driver to alert them of their driving behavior.","5":"Find a safe opportunity to overtake the suspected intoxicated driver if possible and legal.","6":"R_7E72qJbmJHFEIBM"},"89":{"1":"Create a safe distance between his vehicle and the one ahead to avoid any immediate danger.","2":"Call the local law enforcement or highway patrol to report the suspected intoxicated driver, providing the vehicle description and location.","3":"Record the vehicle's license plate number, but only if he can do it safely without causing a distraction or a danger to himself or other road-users.","4":"Require passengers to put on their seat belts if they haven't already to ensure their safety.","5":"Slow down to let the suspected intoxicated driver pull ahead, decreasing the likelihood of a collision.","6":"R_7ExVHzHLu0QK0Kq"},"90":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the car to avoid a potential accident if the driver suddenly swerves.","2":"Try to alert the driver by honking or flashing headlights, in case they are simply distracted and not intoxicated.","3":"Memorize the vehicle's details like its make, model, color, and if possible, license plate number for future reference.","4":"Find a safe place to pull over and call the local authorities to report the incident, providing as many details as possible.","5":"If possible, record the erratic behaviors of the driver using a dashcam or phone, ensuring not to compromise personal safety while doing so.","6":"R_7I9OGOzmBF6uRG1"},"91":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the suspected intoxicated driver to avoid any sudden mishaps.","2":"Note the license plate, car model and color of the suspected intoxicated driver.","3":"Call local law enforcement or the non-emergency police number to report the driver.","4":"If possible without endangering oneself, record the behavior of the driver for evidence.","5":"Avoid trying to stop or confront the driver directly as it could escalate the situation.","6":"R_7INuqY1rcsugVU9"},"92":{"1":"Slow down to maintain a safe distance from the vehicle in question.","2":"Get the license plate number of the seemingly intoxicated driver.","3":"Find a safe place to pull over and call the local authorities or 911, providing them with the details including the car's make, model, color, and license plate number.","4":"Avoid attempting to pass the vehicle unless it becomes absolutely necessary and safe to do so.","5":"Activate his hazard lights to alert other motorists of the potential danger ahead.","6":"R_7IXVwKHjO3yC5VF"},"93":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the vehicle in question, to avoid getting into an accident if it suddenly changes lanes or slows down.","2":"Call the local non-emergency police number to report a potentially intoxicated driver providing them the vehicle's description and number plate, and the road you're on.","3":"Record the erratic driving if it's safe to do so, as video evidence may be helpful for police.","4":"Use a hands-free device to inform any family or friends traveling on the same road about the possible danger, advising them to be alert if they are nearby.","5":"If possible, take a different route to your destination to completely avoid the potentially dangerous situation.","6":"R_7JxiFwRh4URNBDz"},"94":{"1":"Keep a safe distance from the driver, reducing the risk of a collision if the driver ahead loses control.","2":"Make note of the car's license plate number, make\/model, and distinguishable characteristics in case it becomes necessary to report the driver.","3":"Attempt to pull over and call the local legal authorities, informing them of the situation including the direction of travel of the suspected intoxicated driver.","4":"Use a hands-free device to call for help while maintaining control of his own vehicle.","5":"Make a mental or voice recording note of the exact time and location in case it becomes necessary to provide these details later.","6":"R_7LoMJxBSqbzqZIb"},"95":{"1":"Keep a safe distance from the car in question to avoid any sudden erratic moves they might make.","2":"Use a hands-free device to call the local law enforcement office, describing the car\u2019s appearance, direction, and suspected intoxication.","3":"Try to capture the license plate of the car, but only if it can be done safely without causing any traffic violations or risks.","4":"If the situation becomes expressly dangerous, pull over to the shoulder safely and let the erratic car move further away before continuing on the journey.","5":"Use hazard lights or horn actions to alert other drivers around about the potential hands-on situation.","6":"R_7OSKSsj8YSeRecb"},"96":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the suspected intoxicated driver to avoid any sudden collisions.","2":"Attempt to record the license plate number, car model, and color to provide specific information to the authorities.","3":"If possible, pull over to a safe location and dial local authorities or emergency numbers to report the erratic driver.","4":"Try to signal the driver subtly, if it's safe, to get them off the road, but without instigating a road rage incident.","5":"Avoid trying to confront or stop the driver on your own; instead, allow law enforcement officials to handle the situation.","6":"R_7QLwOIG407NVAhW"},"97":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the suspected intoxicated driver to prevent any potential accidents.","2":"Attempt to capture the vehicle's license plate number and details such as the color, make, and model of the car.","3":"Immediately report the behavior to local law enforcement, providing them with the car's description and the location.","4":"If possible and safe, Eamon could attempt to overtake the car while adhering to road safety regulations.","5":"Ensure that his own driving behavior is safe, predictable, and lawful to minimize risks to himself and other road users.","6":"R_7RkxpXGygp7OzlL"},"98":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the suspected intoxicated driver to avoid any sudden maneuvers they might make.","2":"Attempt to remember or note down the make, model, and license plate of the car if it's safe to do so.","3":"Pull over to the side of the road in a safe location to call local law enforcement and report the suspected intoxicated driver. Provide them with as much information as possible.","4":"Use a hands-free device to alert 911 while driving, if pulling over is not an option. Give a detailed description of the vehicle and its behavior.","5":"Avoid trying to pass the car if possible, as the erratic driving could cause an accident.","6":"R_7TF4zzsm03FVP23"},"99":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the potentially intoxicated driver to avoid any unpredictable movements.","2":"Observe the driver's behavior to verify if they are indeed under the influence, looking for signs such as erratic speeds or ignoring traffic signals.","3":"Consider pulling over to the side of the road and report the erratic driving to local law enforcement, providing them with as much detailed information as possible.","4":"Make note of the car's make, model, color, and license plate number, if visible, in order to report it to the authorities.","5":"Avoid attempting to pass the vehicle unless it is absolutely necessary and safe to do so, to prevent any potential accidents.","6":"R_7To6bTmH0LLIlj1"},"100":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the vehicle to avoid collision if the car ahead were to drive erratically.","2":"Record the license plate number and the make and model of the car to report to the authorities.","3":"Contact local traffic authorities or police immediately and provide the recorded details to them.","4":"If it's safe, try to bypass the car to avoid it altogether.","5":"Use the flashing lights or horn to alert the other driver of their improper road behavior to provoke a safer driving adjustment before the authorities arrive.","6":"R_7V7vJh2TtYI1v3y"},"101":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the suspected intoxicated driver to avoid any sudden accidents.","2":"Alert other drivers by using hazard lights if it's safe to do so.","3":"Pull over to the side of the road and call the local authorities to report the suspected intoxicated driver.","4":"Do not attempt to overtake the intoxicated driver, as this could put Eamon at risk.","5":"Record the vehicle's license plate number, description, and direction of travel to provide accurate information to the authorities.","6":"R_7YchAmm5UAsjbKp"},"102":{"1":"Stay at a safe distance from the suspected drunk driver to avoid sudden maneuvers.","2":"Call the local law enforcement or emergency services to report the reckless driving and provide a vehicle description.","3":"If possible, get the license plate of the suspected intoxicated driver's vehicle for the report.","4":"Avoid attempting to pass the vehicle. This could be dangerous considering the unpredictable driving pattern.","5":"Alert other drivers, if possible, by flashing lights or honking the horn. Avoid these actions if they may confuse or startle the suspected intoxicated driver.","6":"R_7anMmLzOj3sQNdD"},"103":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the suspected intoxicated driver to avoid any possible sudden changes in their driving behavior.","2":"Activate the car's hazard lights to alert other drivers of the potential problem.","3":"Note the make, model, and license plate of the suspected intoxicated driver's vehicle.","4":"Contact the local police or highway patrol to report the suspected intoxicated driver, providing them with as much information as possible.","5":"If safe to do so, and not already there, move to the right-hand lane to allow the suspected intoxicated driver to pass more easily.","6":"R_7fSMCxP1Mg54E8p"},"104":{"1":"Safely increase distance from the suspected intoxicated driver to avoid potential unpredictable movements.","2":"Attempt to identify any specific details about the driver's car, such as the make, model, color, or license plate number.","3":"Find a safe place to pull over and call the local police or highway patrol to report the driver.","4":"If the driver stops or pulls over, do not approach them by yourself. Wait for law enforcement to arrive.","5":"Avoid trying to pass the suspected drunk driver unless it's absolutely necessary and can be done safely.","6":"R_7hwzCU5hHwsHUoV"},"105":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the vehicle ahead to avoid any sudden incidents caused by erratic driving.","2":"Try to note down the license plate number of the vehicle.","3":"If possible, safely overtake the vehicle in question to avoid being directly behind it.","4":"Report the suspected intoxicated driver to local law enforcement by providing a description of the vehicle, its location, and driving behavior.","5":"Use a hands-free device to call the police so as not to get distracted from driving.","6":"R_7k53oihTTJSu7wX"},"106":{"1":"Slow down and increase the distance between his vehicle and the erratic vehicle to avoid a potential collision.","2":"Observe the erratic driver's behavior for further signs of intoxication, such as sudden acceleration or deceleration, failing to indicate, and inconsistent speeds.","3":"Note down the vehicle's make, model, color, and license plate number, if it's safe to do so.","4":"Warn other drivers if possible by flashing his headlights or honking his horn when it's safe and necessary.","5":"Call the local non-emergency police number to report the situation, providing the vehicle's description and location.","6":"R_7lnp7fZJQqVaGzy"},"107":{"1":"Create some distance between his vehicle and the suspected intoxicated driver to ensure his safety.","2":"Call the local police department or emergency line to report the incident, providing them with the vehicle's description and plate number if visible.","3":"Record the erratic behavior if possible and safe to do so, to provide evidence to the concerned authorities.","4":"Avoid overtaking the vehicle to prevent any potential accident.","5":"Use his car's horn or lights to alert the driver to their erratic driving, if it's safe to do so.","6":"R_7mJkSFegDSIFZtg"},"108":{"1":"Keep a safe distance from the driver ahead to avoid potential accidents.","2":"Immediately call the local police or highway patrol to report the driver, giving the vehicle's description and license plate number.","3":"Start recording the vehicle's erratic behavior with his phone's camera or dashcam, if he has one, for evidence.","4":"Avoid any attempt to overtake or engage with the suspected drunk driver.","5":"Look for the nearest safe place to pull over and allow the driver to continue ahead, removing himself from immediate danger.","6":"R_7oyJfk5ANW3SJ2A"},"109":{"1":"Safely increase the distance between his car and the suspected intoxicated driver's car to protect himself from a potential accident.","2":"Contact the local authorities to report the suspected intoxicated driver, providing them with the car's model, color, and license plate number.","3":"Use his car's dashboard camera, if available, to record the intoxicated driver's behavior as evidence.","4":"Avoid trying to overtake the suspected intoxicated driver, as this could lead to a dangerous situation.","5":"Keep his seatbelt fastened at all times and ensure that any passengers in his car have their seatbelts fastened as well, to prepare for any unexpected occurrences.","6":"R_7pMWQLM0Wp5sEWl"},"110":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance to avoid a potential accident with the erratic driver.","2":"Attempt to note down the car's make, model, and license plate number for possible reporting.","3":"If possible, without risking his own safety, pass the potentially intoxicated driver when the road is clear to do so.","4":"Report the situation to local law enforcement, providing as much detailed information as possible.","5":"Turn on his hazard lights to warn other drivers about the potential danger on the road.","6":"R_7rDleE1AbpJKQI2"},"111":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the suspected intoxicated driver to avoid a potential collision.","2":"Try to identify any distinctive features of the car such as its color, make, model, or license plate number.","3":"Call the local law enforcement agency or the non-emergency police number to report the incident, providing them with as much detail as possible.","4":"If possible and safe, record the erratic behavior of the other driver using a dash cam or mobile phone, but ensure not to use the phone while driving.","5":"Try to alert other drivers in a safe manner, for example, by flashing headlights or using a car horn, but make sure not to cause panic or additional danger.","6":"R_7re77puvrIgRBwB"},"112":{"1":"Keep a safe distance from the possibly intoxicated driver, ensuring an adequate braking space.","2":"Alert other road users by flashing his lights or honking cautiously to gain their attention towards the erratic driver.","3":"Attempt to record evidence of the erratic driving behavior with a smartphone or dashcam without compromising his own safety.","4":"Contact the local police or highway patrol to report the perceived intoxicated driver, providing them with the make, model, color, and licence plate number of the vehicle.","5":"Consider taking alternate routes to avoid driving behind the potentially dangerous driver.","6":"R_7ruqhY3TaeynaIp"},"113":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the suspected intoxicated driver to avoid any potential accidents.","2":"If possible, safely change lanes or take a different route to avoid driving behind the potentially dangerous vehicle.","3":"Note the color, make, model, and license plate of the vehicle for identification purposes.","4":"Without risking his own safety, Eamon can try to record the driver\u2019s erratic behavior as evidence.","5":"Call the local authorities, providing them with the observed details of the situation, including the specific location and direction the driver is heading.","6":"R_7uQq9IlFDf6Cifn"},"114":{"1":"Maintain a safe distance from the suspected intoxicated driver.","2":"Turn on vehicle's dashboard camera to record the erratic driving for evidence.","3":"Use a hands-free device to call the local non-emergency police number and report the situation.","4":"Try to take note of the vehicle's license plate number, type, and color without endangering himself.","5":"If possible, turn off from the road or take a different route home to avoid any possible accidents.","6":"R_7xPqzNl1qJ5xEIC"},"115":{"1":"Increase distance between his car and the suspected intoxicated driver's car to avoid potential hazards.","2":"Record the license plate number and other details of the car so it can be reported to the authorities.","3":"Try to signal the driver indicating that something is wrong, if it's safe.","4":"Consider taking a different route home to ensure his safety.","5":"Call the local police and report the driver's erratic behavior, providing complete details about the car and its location.","6":"R_7zbKxBPOIN72nZL"}},"Randomization":"Subset","TotalRandSubset":1}}},"66":{"Type":"Standard","SubType":"","Description":"Scenario5","ID":"BL_cuO66AmYKIX9eEC","BlockElements":[{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID818"},{"Type":"Page Break"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID1019"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID819"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID820"},{"Type":"Page Break"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID995"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID827"},{"Type":"Page Break"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID821"},{"Type":"Page Break"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID822"},{"Type":"Page Break"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID823"},{"Type":"Page Break"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID824"},{"Type":"Page Break"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID825"},{"Type":"Page Break"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID826"},{"Type":"Page Break"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID1037"},{"Type":"Page Break"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID1006"},{"Type":"Page Break"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID964"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID965"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID966"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID967"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID968"}],"Options":{"BlockLocking":false,"RandomizeQuestions":"false","BlockVisibility":"Collapsed","Looping":"Static","LoopingOptions":{"Static":{"1":{"1":"Politely decline the woman's request, citing inconvenience due to the additional distance.","2":"Inquire about her circumstances and reasons for needing a ride before making a decision.","3":"Agree to give the woman a ride to the nearby city, if Cameron feels comfortable and if it doesn\u2019t significantly disrupt his schedule.","4":"Offer to call a taxi or another type of service to take the woman to her destination.","5":"Inform the gas station attendance or nearby authorities in case the woman appears to be in distress or trouble.","6":"R_11QmTSMqpn3V0zL"},"2":{"1":"Evaluate the situation and decide if he feels comfortable giving a stranger a ride.","2":"Ask the woman more information about why she needs a ride to the nearby city.","3":"Consider the cost and time of the additional miles to his journey.","4":"Inform the woman about any local transportation alternatives like buses or taxis.","5":"If he agrees to give her a ride, let a family member or a friend know about the situation for safety reasons.","6":"R_14HOA7OpsxxMkV8"},"3":{"1":"Ask the woman for more details about her situation to assess whether the situation could be potentially dangerous or inconvenient.","2":"Consider the extra mileage and calculate whether he has enough gas and time for the unexpected detour.","3":"Call up family members or friends to inform them about the situation and the possible delay to his expected time of arrival home.","4":"Offer to call a taxi or an Uber for the woman, should he decide he is not comfortable giving her a ride.","5":"Ensure to protect his own safety; if he decides to help, he may ask to see her identification first, or insist on public places as pick-up and drop-off points.","6":"R_172SUVOzbqsydYm"},"4":{"1":"Politely ask the woman for more details about her situation to determine if it's safe and appropriate to assist.","2":"Consider the amount of gas in the car and spare time left to evaluate if adding an extra 10 miles is feasible.","3":"If convinced to help, ask the woman to wait while you inform a family member or friend about the detour and the passenger you\u2019ve spontaneously taken aboard.","4":"Double-check the exact location where she needs to be dropped, input it into your GPS, and confirm the route.","5":"Before beginning the journey, make sure both of you are wearing seatbelts and adhere to the road safety rules along the trip.","6":"R_186igmeqA8uoA3D"},"5":{"1":"Assess the situation and the woman's behavior to ensure personal safety before making a decision.","2":"Politely ask the woman additional questions to ascertain the urgency or necessity of her request.","3":"Offer to call a taxi or arrange for a rideshare service to help her reach her destination if he doesn't feel comfortable giving her a ride.","4":"Decide to drive the woman to the nearby city while ensuring fuel efficiency and car capacity.","5":"Ensure the car has enough fuel for the extra 10 miles and refill the vehicle if required.","6":"R_1B3yUYDk0ATzOrL"},"6":{"1":"Agree to giving the woman a ride and ensure she feels comfortable and safe in his car.","2":"Clarify if there is any specific place in the said city that the woman wants to be dropped off at.","3":"Ask the woman if she has any time constraints, as he might need to stop at his house first before driving her to the city.","4":"Politely decline giving the woman a ride if he is not comfortable doing so.","5":"Suggest other transportation options to her if he is unable to assist, such as nearby bus stations, taxi services, or ride-sharing apps.","6":"R_1CJkX5mcSvFo2J3"},"7":{"1":"Ask the woman more about her situation before deciding whether or not to help.","2":"Consider if his schedule allows for the extra drive and time.","3":"Assess the safety implications of offering the stranger a ride.","4":"Tell her that he needs to think about it and ask for her contact information so he can reach out later.","5":"Propose an alternative, such as calling a taxi or a ride-sharing service for her instead.","6":"R_1FoMVTIovcMTXJT"},"8":{"1":"Assess if he has enough time and gas to safely take the woman to the nearby city and still return home.","2":"Politely ask the woman for more details about her situation to ensure his own safety.","3":"Offer to call a taxi or another form of transportation for the woman if he is unable to assist.","4":"Ask the gas station attendant or any other present authority about the woman\u2019s sincerity, or if they know any available resources for her.","5":"Consider his personal safety and obligations before agreeing to give the woman a ride.","6":"R_1H1Uw3bUXGuY5Qk"},"9":{"1":"Politely decline the woman's request explaining his current circumstances and suggesting she seek a public transport option instead.","2":"Accept to give the woman a ride and adjust his travel plans accordingly.","3":"Contact a taxi or rideshare service for the woman if he is uncomfortable driving her to the desired location.","4":"Inquire more about the woman's situation to better understand her request and assess the risk involved.","5":"Offer to alert a nearby police station or road service for assistance if the woman appears to be in distress.","6":"R_1J30S3Bt0e7B63Q"},"10":{"1":"Politely tell the woman he cannot provide the ride due to his scheduling or other personal reasons.","2":"Agree to give her a ride as long as it doesn't significantly detour from his planned route home.","3":"Offer to call a taxi or ride-sharing service for the woman if he feels uncomfortable giving a stranger a ride.","4":"Suggest she find a local public transportation option, such as a bus or train.","5":"Direct her to the gas station staff to ask for assistance if she appears to be in distress or facing a crisis.","6":"R_1Oq2aa0rEDoAdRB"},"11":{"1":"Ask the woman for more information about her situation, to ensure personal safety.","2":"Consider the amount of gas in the car and whether it will be enough to drive to the city and back home.","3":"Assess the time it would take to get to the city and back, ensuring it doesn't conflict with any of his plans.","4":"Offer to call a cab or rideshare for her if he's unable to give her a ride.","5":"Agree to give her a ride, but request she contributes towards the additional gas cost.","6":"R_1P7Wl05XdG8Qljz"},"12":{"1":"Assess the woman's situation and reasoning before offering help to decide if it is safe or feasible.","2":"Politely decline the woman's request, explaining he was not planning to go that far.","3":"Offer to take the woman as far as his own destination, minimizing his detour but still assisting her.","4":"Agree to take the woman to the nearby city, considering his fuel level and time constraints to ensure it won't disrupt his own plans.","5":"Suggest alternative options to the woman, such as advising her to try a taxi service or a ride-sharing app.","6":"R_1PsPUuPcckPaW0h"},"13":{"1":"Politely decline the woman's request, explaining it's too far and out of his initial plan.","2":"Accept to give the woman a ride to the nearby city if he doesn't mind adding an extra 10 miles to his journey.","3":"Offer to drop the woman at a midway point, which is less inconvenient for him.","4":"Encourage the woman to use a public means such as a bus or a taxi to the nearby city.","5":"Ask the woman for fuel money to compensate for the extra distance he'll cover to the nearby city.","6":"R_1SSGs3U7Ysud5oR"},"14":{"1":"Consider the woman\u2019s request and evaluate his comfort in providing a ride to a stranger.","2":"Verify the woman's identity or ask for additional details to ensure safety.","3":"Assess if he has enough fuel to transport the woman to the city and still get home comfortably.","4":"Politely decline the request, if he feels uncomfortable or unable to accommodate her.","5":"Offer to call a taxi or other transportation services for her if he doesn't feel secure taking her himself.","6":"R_1kaKQ4Ryoiex7Xx"},"15":{"1":"Ask the woman about the urgency of her situation and decide if he can accommodate the extra miles.","2":"Politely decline and suggest she request a ride from a reliable taxi or ride-sharing service instead.","3":"Agree to give her a ride but request that she contributes to the additional fuel cost.","4":"Contact local law enforcement or a local outreach program for the woman, in case she's in distress and needs more immediate help.","5":"Check with others at the gas station if they are heading in the direction of the woman's destination and could possibly give her a ride.","6":"R_1kjI7iAWjtWuBtD"},"16":{"1":"Politely decline the woman's request if Cameron does not feel comfortable doing so, citing the extra distance and any personal reasons.","2":"Agree to give the woman a ride if Cameron feels comfortable and safe, ensuring that he has enough fuel for the extra distance.","3":"Contact a local taxi service or advise the woman to use a ridesharing app, if he doesn\u2019t want to drive her himself.","4":"Suggest public transportation options such as buses or trains that might be able to get the woman to the city.","5":"Offer to take the woman to a nearby safe location like a bus station or a well-lit area, if it's late and public transportation is not readily available.","6":"R_1q9FXHr3KLkEuRA"},"17":{"1":"Politely decline the woman's request if Cameron feels uncomfortable or unsafe with the situation.","2":"Accept the woman's request and drive her to the nearby city, factoring in the extra gas and time costs.","3":"Ask the woman more questions about her situation to make a more informed decision about whether or not to help her.","4":"Point her towards a nearby public transportation option, such as a bus stop or taxi stand, if one is available.","5":"Contact local non-emergency services for assistance, if he believes the woman is in distress but doesn't feel equipped to help her directly.","6":"R_1r8AXjOaubSVFG9"},"18":{"1":"Politely ask the woman for more details about her situation to fully understand why she needs help.","2":"Assess his own safety and comfort level with giving the woman a ride.","3":"Consider whether he has enough fuel, time, and is familiar with the added distance.","4":"Offer to call a cab or recommend a rideshare app if he is unable to assist.","5":"If he decides to help, make sure he informs someone about this detour and the situation.","6":"R_1s5qT1UVcDCQ4kO"},"19":{"1":"Assess the situation and woman's request, considering factors such as distance, fuel costs, and personal safety.","2":"Politely ask the woman why she needs the ride and if there is any urgency to her request.","3":"Consider offering to call a taxi or rideshare service for the woman if Cameron himself is uncomfortable with the situation.","4":"Evaluate how much additional time it would take to drive the extra 10 miles and if it would significantly disrupt Cameron's plans.","5":"If comfortable, agree to give the woman a ride, ensuring to remind her to fasten her seatbelt as a safety measure.","6":"R_1wglSq2Y3UuKlTv"},"20":{"1":"Assess the woman's situation and request, considering factors such as the time of day, the additional distance, and her apparent need.","2":"Politely ask her more about why she needs a ride and where exactly in the city she needs to go.","3":"Consider offering to call a taxi or rideshare service for her, particularly if he isn't comfortable giving her a lift.","4":"Weigh the benefits and drawbacks of helping her out versus the extra gas and time he would need to spend.","5":"Decide whether to agree to her request or to suggest alternatives, placing personal safety and comfort as priority considerations.","6":"R_307uPDiy8d2sRPU"},"21":{"1":"Politely explain to the woman that he can't go 10 miles out of his way but is willing to drop her at a closer location.","2":"Offer to call or pay for her a taxi or a rideshare service to get to her destination.","3":"Suggest other possible transport options such as a local bus or train that could take her to the city.","4":"Question her further to understand her safety situation, it might be that she is in distress and needs immediate help.","5":"Agree to take her the entire way to the city but ask for contribution towards the additional fuel cost.","6":"R_32Kj2ZsL2wJkCMF"},"22":{"1":"Consider the fuel level of his car and whether it can accommodate an extra 20 miles round-trip.","2":"Ask for more information about why the woman needs a ride to assess the situation better.","3":"Evaluate personal safety and whether giving a ride to a stranger poses any risks.","4":"Consult his schedule to ensure that the additional drive will not interfere with any planned activities.","5":"Check with the woman if she can contribute to the extra fuel cost for the additional mileage.","6":"R_390lu0Gj35K6IXD"},"23":{"1":"Assess the woman's situation and ask for further details, such as the urgency, reason for travel, and if she can offer reimbursement for the extra fuel costs.","2":"Politely decline the request, citing his own plans and the extra distance he wasn't prepared to travel.","3":"Accept the woman's request and give her a ride, considering it as an act of kindness regardless of the extra miles.","4":"Ask the woman if there are any other means she can use to reach her destination, such as public transportation or a taxi.","5":"Contact a friend or family member and discuss the situation with them to get a second opinion before making a decision.","6":"R_3ATB9HO6kmvTxvj"},"24":{"1":"Politely inquire more about the woman's situation to understand her need for a ride.","2":"Consider the amount of fuel needed for the additional distance to the nearby city and refill accordingly.","3":"Confirm the exact location where she needs to be dropped off to calculate the exact detour required.","4":"Ensure that his schedule allows for the additional time it would take to drive 10 miles further.","5":"Inform a trusted person about giving a ride to an unknown individual for safety reasons.","6":"R_3EgmqsLMkGuq4Ab"},"25":{"1":"Assess her situation by asking the woman why she needs a ride and if she has any other options.","2":"Consider his fuel level and decide if he can afford the additional miles without refueling again.","3":"Evaluate the safety of offering a ride to a stranger.","4":"Make a decision based on his comfort level, the woman's situation, and his own schedule and needs.","5":"If he decides to offer the ride, ensure to inform someone close to him about his plan and provide details of the woman for safety purposes.","6":"R_3G2GZOQJN0KBFKW"},"26":{"1":"Politely ask for more information about why she needs a ride, to assess the urgency and legitimacy of the request.","2":"Consider whether he has enough gas, or if he can afford additional gas to go the extra distance.","3":"Evaluate his schedule and determine if he has enough time to accommodate the detour.","4":"Consider his personal safety and if he feels comfortable giving a ride to a stranger.","5":"If he agrees to give the ride, set some ground rules for the journey such as where will he drop her off.","6":"R_3H2KU07RsWqqKoj"},"27":{"1":"Offer the woman a ride to the nearby city if he has sufficient fuel and time.","2":"Politely refuse the woman's request if he feels uncomfortable or unsafe.","3":"Suggest that the woman tries a rideshare app or calls a taxi if he is unable to assist.","4":"Call a local non-emergency help line for assistance or advice if he's unsure.","5":"Offer to take the woman part of the way, as far as his planned route, if the full journey isn't convenient.","6":"R_3ImeqLQ09a7POs9"},"28":{"1":"Assess the situation and the woman's request to gauge personal safety before making a decision.","2":"Politely ask the woman why she needs a ride to the city and if there are any other options she has considered.","3":"Offer to call a taxi, ride-share service, or local authorities on her behalf if he isn't comfortable giving her a ride.","4":"If he is willing and feels safe, agree to give her a ride, ensuring they first establish a consensus about drop-off spot and any detours required.","5":"Check fuel level and, if necessary, refill the tank to ensure it is sufficient for the extra distance.","6":"R_3JENViVO0sB02fo"},"29":{"1":"Ask the woman for more details about her situation to assess if it's a genuine request or possibly a security risk.","2":"Politely decline the request if Cameron feels uncomfortable or unsafe with the situation, offering to call a taxi or suggest public transport instead.","3":"Agree to give the woman a ride, but ensure to inform a family member or friend about the situation for security purposes.","4":"Offer to give the woman a ride part of the way, suggesting a point that is not out of Cameron's way.","5":"Offer to call the police or a social service agency if the woman appears to be in dire need or distress.","6":"R_3LBOjfwqB9iLXfX"},"30":{"1":"Decide to help, calculate the gas for extra miles, and drive the woman to the nearby city.","2":"Create a safe boundary by calling a taxi or ride-sharing service for the woman instead of taking her personally.","3":"Consider the woman's safety and guide her to the gas station's inside, where there might be trained personnel who could help.","4":"Politely decline her request explaining that you are not comfortable providing a ride to strangers.","5":"Ask her more details about her situation, offering to call a friend or family member to pick her up.","6":"R_3LneE8eRBHnaDhm"},"31":{"1":"Politely decline the woman's request and explain that he doesn't want to drive additional miles beyond his house.","2":"Agree to give the woman a ride to the nearby city, as long as she contributes to gas money for the additional 10 miles.","3":"Suggest alternative transportation options to the woman, such as public transit or ride shares, if they are available.","4":"Call a taxi or a ride share for the woman, offering to pay for the ride if he feels comfortable doing so.","5":"Provide the woman with directions to the nearby city and advise her on the best routes to take.","6":"R_3MEaPnuf84Cwca2"},"32":{"1":"Politely decline citing personal or safety reasons, if Cameron is not comfortable with the situation.","2":"Ask the woman why she needs the ride and make a decision based on his judgement of the situation.","3":"Offer to call a taxi or other transportation for her if he has the means and feels the situation justifies it.","4":"Agree to give the woman a ride if he feels safe and comfortable doing so, but verify the location and decide if the extra journey is manageable.","5":"If possible, involve a gas station attendant or other witnesses. They could help assess the situation and deter potential safety risks.","6":"R_3MhP6L7CtQyC4lf"},"33":{"1":"Consider the woman's safety and his own before making a decision.","2":"Offer to call a taxi or other transportation service for the woman.","3":"Drive her to the requested city if it is safe and won't significantly disrupt his plans.","4":"Negotiate on a halfway drop-off point that wouldn't deviate much from his planned route.","5":"Decline politely explaining that it's beyond his way or due to personal reasons.","6":"R_3PYpVRXFdtavB3y"},"34":{"1":"Assess the woman's situation to determine if it's safe and appropriate to give her a ride. This could include asking her why she needs a ride and evaluating her overall demeanor.","2":"Consider whether he has enough gas to reach the additional destination and still get home without needing to refill.","3":"Evaluate his schedule to ensure he has enough time to drive the extra miles without being late for other obligations.","4":"Offer to call a taxi or rideshare service for the woman if he decides not to give her a ride.","5":"Decide to give the woman a ride, ensuring to inform a friend or family member about it for safety reasons.","6":"R_3RTZTgG0o3PS9UW"},"35":{"1":"Assess the overall situation and listen to the woman's request carefully.","2":"Evaluate gas level and calculate the additional travel distance to determine if the car has enough fuel to get to the destination and back.","3":"Ask the woman for more details about her situation and why she needs a ride to that specific city, in order to better understand the urgency of her request.","4":"Consider safety precautions given the situation, such as contacting a friend or family member to inform them of the situation.","5":"Make a decision on whether to give the woman a ride based on his assessment of the situation, fuel availability, and personal comfort with the situation.","6":"R_3aLdW76pDfd71cy"},"36":{"1":"Ask the woman for more information about why she needs a ride to evaluate the situation better.","2":"Check his car's fuel level to see if he has enough to extend his trip by 20 miles and back without needing to refill again.","3":"Consider the current time and his plans at home to evaluate whether he has enough time for this detour.","4":"Ask the woman if she can contribute to the cost of the additional gas needed for the detour.","5":"Evaluate his sense of personal safety and comfort with giving a ride to a stranger.","6":"R_3eabTgd20Ow0wGm"},"37":{"1":"Politely tell the woman that he can't help this time as he needs to conserve his fuel and it's beyond his way.","2":"Accept her request and drop her at the city if he is comfortable with the situation and after considering any potential security risks.","3":"Offer to call a taxi or ride-sharing service for the woman if he doesn't feel comfortable driving her.","4":"Suggest she ask the gas station attendees or other customers for help.","5":"Inquire more details about her situation to ascertain her genuine need and assess his own level of comfort with helping.","6":"R_3ewVtTkXFpJCoL4"},"38":{"1":"Assess the woman's situation and ask for more details about why she needs a ride, to ensure personal safety and the legitimacy of the request.","2":"Offer to call a taxi or a ride-share service for her if he feels uncomfortable or is unable to help.","3":"Decide to drive the woman to the city if he feels safe to do so, considering it's only slightly out of his way.","4":"Consider informing someone, like a friend or family member, about the situation and his decision to ensure his own safety.","5":"If agrees to help, ask the woman to contribute to gas expenses, since the trip will require additional mileage.","6":"R_3patELwfLXC0uhn"},"39":{"1":"Assess the woman's situation and ask her why she needs the ride. His decision might change depending on the urgency of her circumstances.","2":"Consider the fuel capacity of his car and calculate if the additional 10 miles will be covered without needing another fuel stop.","3":"Get the exact address in the nearby city where the woman needs to go and use a GPS or map to check the route.","4":"Call home and inform them of the situation and that he may arrive later than planned.","5":"Evaluate his personal safety and belongings before allowing the woman to enter his car, ensuring they are secure.","6":"R_3qBYt2f19xfdpDo"},"40":{"1":"Assess the situation to ensure personal security before making a decision.","2":"Politely ask the woman about her situation to gauge her level of distress or urgency.","3":"Offer to call a cab or ride-hailing service for her if Cameron feels uncomfortable giving a ride himself.","4":"Agree to give her a ride if he feels safe and it won't significantly disrupt his journey.","5":"Suggest the woman ask the gas station staff for assistance, they might have resources to assist stranded travelers.","6":"R_3qVgXuEX5dSVSJs"},"41":{"1":"Kindly inform the woman that he can drop her off at a location on his way home, but he is not planning on driving the full 10 miles extra.","2":"Offer to call a cab or a rideshare service for her if he potentially worries about her safety or security.","3":"Ask the woman for more details about her situation to assess if he could potentially provide more suitable assistance.","4":"Agree to drive the extra 10 miles to help the woman get to her destination, considering it as a good deed. Make sure to let someone at home aware about the detour.","5":"Invite the woman to wait at the gas station, and ask the staff if there is any local transport service that could help her reach the city.","6":"R_3yI51or5FDptQ53"},"42":{"1":"Decide to give the woman a ride, considering the extra distance as a charitable gesture.","2":"Politely refuse her request, explaining that he's had a long day and just wants to get home.","3":"Suggest that she try asking someone else at the gas station who might be heading in that direction.","4":"Offer to call a cab or rideshare service for her if she doesn't have a means to do so.","5":"Inquire more about her situation to determine if it's safe and worth to give her a ride, and based on the obtained information, make a decision.","6":"R_539oITEOi6lQwYi"},"43":{"1":"Assess the situation by asking the woman more information, such as the reason she needs a ride and if she has alternative ways to get to the city.","2":"Consider offering the woman a ride while setting clear boundaries such as no detours.","3":"Contact a cab or rideshare service for the woman if he feels uncomfortable giving her a ride.","4":"Tell the woman politely that he can't accommodate her request as it's out of his way.","5":"Ask the gas station attendant or other people nearby if they know of any local transportation options that could be suggested to the woman.","6":"R_57PuK84ldBDlRue"},"44":{"1":"Evaluate the situation and consider if he has enough time and gas to help the woman.","2":"Politely ask the woman more information about her situation to ensure his safety.","3":"Kindly suggest alternative transportation methods such as a taxi or rideshare service.","4":"Consider contacting friends or family who might be going towards the same city to arrange a ride for the woman.","5":"Offer to drive the woman part of the way, if the extra distance seems too out of his way.","6":"R_5BHyamjAkN0ukX7"},"45":{"1":"Assess the woman's condition and behavior before making a decision. Confirm whether she poses a potential threat.","2":"Inquire more about the woman's circumstances - why she needs to go to the nearby city and why she doesn't have any other mode of transportation.","3":"Consider the extra distance in terms of fuel and time. Determine whether he has enough time and gas to take the detour and still fulfil obligations at home.","4":"Contact someone - family, friend, or spouse - and inform them about the situation for safety reasons. Should he decide to assist the woman, somebody else should know.","5":"If conceivable, suggest alternative ways she could reach her destination (e.g. calling a taxi or using a ride-hailing service) instead of personally taking her there.","6":"R_5C9B45MNYrLOfo5"},"46":{"1":"Assess the woman's situation and motive by asking a few brief questions to understand why she needs a ride.","2":"Consider his personal safety and security before deciding whether to offer the woman a ride.","3":"Check his fuel and time situation to ensure he can afford both the extra miles and the time it would take to drop the woman at her destination.","4":"If he feels uncertain or uncomfortable, suggest that the woman consider public transportation or a taxi service instead.","5":"If he decides to help, confirm the exact location where she wants to be dropped off to ensure it doesn't cause too much of a detour from his route.","6":"R_5DLN0ftgOrFctEm"},"47":{"1":"Consider the woman's request and evaluate if he has enough time and fuel to go the extra 10 miles.","2":"Ask the woman for more details about her situation to ensure that it's safe to give her a ride.","3":"Call a cab or an Uber for the woman if he doesn't feel comfortable giving her a ride.","4":"Recommend local public transit options for the woman to reach her destination if he is unable to help.","5":"Politely decline the request if he feels uncomfortable or unable to assist, citing his intended route and final destination as the reason.","6":"R_5EAKepygSSRnUOZ"},"48":{"1":"Assess the situation and ensure safety; consider factors like the time of day, surrounding environment, or the general behavior of the woman.","2":"Agree to give the woman a ride, factoring in the extra fuel consumption and time it would take to return home.","3":"Politely decline and suggest alternative ways for her to reach her destination, like a cab service or public transportation.","4":"Offer to call a cab or a ride-sharing service for the woman if he feels uncomfortable giving her a ride.","5":"Seek help from the gas station attendants or any security personnel in the vicinity for advice or assistance.","6":"R_5InK0D7KARHhia4"},"49":{"1":"Politely inquire why she requires assistance to get a clearer understanding of her situation.","2":"Offer to arrange for an Uber or Lyft if Cameron is uncomfortable giving the woman a ride, but is willing to help her out.","3":"Assess his fuel and time constraints to determine if he can accommodate the extra mileage.","4":"Check with local police or gas station staff if the woman is known or seems suspicious.","5":"Consider reporting the encounter to the appropriate authorities if he deems the situation to possibly be of potential risk or danger.","6":"R_5MMRE7RJ1lDv3oT"},"50":{"1":"Politely ask the woman for more information about her situation to assess the level of urgency or need.","2":"Consider the implications of his petrol consumption and the potential for disruption to his own schedule.","3":"Offer to call a cab or a ride-hailing service for the woman if he feels uncomfortable or unable to provide the ride himself.","4":"Decide to give the woman a lift if he has judged that it is safe, fuel-efficient, and time-conducive.","5":"Suggest other alternatives for transportation, such as using local public transit if it is available and safe.","6":"R_5P03OMXGinfGRQN"},"51":{"1":"Ask the woman detailed information about her situation to better understand the urgency or necessity of her request.","2":"Consider the extra fuel cost, time, and distance required for the detour and how this might affect his schedule or plans.","3":"Inform the woman that he needs time to think about her request before giving an affirmative response.","4":"Check the time and traffic situation on the route to the city to assess the feasibility of the trip.","5":"Ensure his own personal safety by asking for the exact location he needs to drop her off, considering it's evening time and a potential risk involved.","6":"R_5R1W8wtD4iBNxth"},"52":{"1":"Consider the woman's request and assess whether he has enough time and fuel to travel the extra 10 miles.","2":"Politely ask the woman if she can contribute towards the extra fuel cost.","3":"Ask her for more information about her situation, such as why she needs a ride, to ensure his own safety.","4":"Consider alternative solutions like suggesting the woman uses a taxi service or public transport if available and safe.","5":"Contact a friend or family member and inform them about the situation for safety reasons.","6":"R_5Rx30T6ER8nLhrx"},"53":{"1":"Ask the woman for more details about her situation to ensure his own safety and determine whether it's reasonable to help her.","2":"Consider the woman's request and compare the extra miles to his fuel level to see if his car can carry the extra distance without requiring another pit stop for gas.","3":"Prioritize his personal safety by politely telling the woman that he doesn't feel comfortable giving strangers a ride.","4":"Offer to call a cab or a rideshare service for the woman as a safe alternative.","5":"Accept her request, ensuring his address is set on GPS for his own safety, and drop her to her destination if he believes it's safe and has enough fuel.","6":"R_5YJ9T5h1bEdxmwo"},"54":{"1":"Politely ask the woman more details about her situation to ensure safety and to be able to make a more informed decision.","2":"Evaluate the car's fuel level and estimate if the additional distance would significantly affect the gas mileage.","3":"Consider the extra time it would take to drive the additional distance and whether his personal schedule would allow for it.","4":"Offer to call for professional transportation service, like a cab or an uber, if he is not able to provide the ride personally.","5":"If he decides to give the woman a lift, ensure to inform someone close about his whereabouts and estimated time of arrival for safety reasons.","6":"R_5eRBvP0sxZai36F"},"55":{"1":"Assess the situation to determine the safety and feasibility of the request. Consider factors such as the current time, weather, and personal comfort with the woman.","2":"Politely ask the woman for additional details about the nature of her need, such as why she is asking for a ride and if there are alternative transportation options she could use.","3":"Consider the additional mileage and whether the car has enough gas to make the extended trip without causing inconvenience.","4":"Weigh the impact on his schedule. Calculate the additional time that would be required and whether or not it conflicts with any of his evening plans.","5":"If the decision is made to help the woman, ensure his phone is charged and inform a friend or family member about the situation for safety purposes.","6":"R_5fBluKBcgQHZhVw"},"56":{"1":"Politely ask the woman for more details about why she needs a ride and consider her response in his decision.","2":"Check the fuel level in his car to ensure that he has enough gas to take the woman to the city and still reach his own home.","3":"Consider his schedule and verify it will not be inconvenienced by driving the extra 10 miles.","4":"Call any family members or roommates to inform them of the situation and the potential delay.","5":"If Cameron feels comfortable and safe, agree to give the woman a ride to the nearby city.","6":"R_5gBeViQ3vboG6oL"},"57":{"1":"Consider safety and establish the trustworthiness of the stranger before agreeing to assist.","2":"Politely inquire about the reason she needs a ride to the city. This could provide valuable context.","3":"Measure the pros and cons of extending the trip by 10 miles. Assess whether he has enough time and fuel to cover the extra distance.","4":"Offer to call a taxi or an Uber for the woman if for any reason Cameron is uncomfortable with giving her a lift.","5":"If Cameron decides to help, ensure to inform a close friend or relative about his detour and the expected time of arrival for safety reasons.","6":"R_5jyTgvSc0EuZ6TL"},"58":{"1":"Assess the woman's situation and ask about the reasons she needs a ride. Evaluate if it's a genuine request or a potential safety risk.","2":"Offer to call a taxi or an Uber for her if he does not feel comfortable giving a ride to a stranger.","3":"Decide to give her a ride but ask her to contribute to gas charges if he is not troubled with the extra mileage.","4":"Explain that he can't help with a ride, but suggest she ask the gas station for assistance - they might be able to help arrange transportation.","5":"If he feels comfortable, agree to help her, emphasizing that this is a one-off situation and it's only due to the city being on his way home.","6":"R_5l9KmcOm7FvYqoC"},"59":{"1":"Evaluate the woman's situation and reason for needing a ride.","2":"Check his vehicle's fuel level and think about driving an extra 10 miles.","3":"Consider his own personal safety and ensure he feels comfortable offering a ride.","4":"Ask the woman more about her destination to determine the exact distance and potential detour.","5":"Weigh his obligations and schedule to decide whether he has time to give the woman a ride.","6":"R_5mrabxkMD9GZC8C"},"60":{"1":"Agree to give the woman a ride, ensuring to adjust his schedule and fuel to accommodate the extra distance.","2":"Politely explain to the woman that he can't give her a ride, but offer to call a taxi or a rideshare service for her.","3":"Ask the woman for more details about her situation, to assess whether it's safe and appropriate to give her a lift.","4":"Offer to drive the woman to a nearby bus station or public transportation stop instead, if it's on his way.","5":"Contact local authorities or a social service agency, if the woman appears to be in distress or it's unsafe for her to travel alone.","6":"R_5msgXIVRWsCr3kP"},"61":{"1":"Consider the implications of diverting his route home, taking into account fuel consumption, time required, and potential delay.","2":"Politely ask the woman more details about her situation to assess if it's a genuine need or safety risk.","3":"Contact local transportation or ride-sharing options and offer their services to the woman.","4":"Offer to drive the woman part of the way if he is unable to take her all the way to her destination.","5":"Consider contacting local authorities or social services if the woman seems to be in distress or danger.","6":"R_5mz1LcS70MSCdU6"},"62":{"1":"Evaluate the woman's request by considering factors such as his current fuel level, how much time he has, and whether he feels comfortable giving her a ride.","2":"Ask more information from the woman, such as why she needs a ride and if there's anyone else who can help her.","3":"Consider calling a taxi or ride-sharing service for her if he doesn\u2019t feel comfortable or it's not convenient to take her.","4":"Offer to drive her as far as his house, if it's on the way to the city, and she can arrange for further transportation from there.","5":"Politely decline her request if he feels it would be significantly inconvenient or potentially unsafe.","6":"R_5n7Ya8yEWVBA6Ip"},"63":{"1":"Politely decline the woman's request, citing his need to get home and the extra distance as his reason.","2":"Accept to give the woman a ride to the city if he has enough time, keeping safety and respect as a priority.","3":"Offer to call a taxi or a ride-sharing service for the woman if he does not feel comfortable giving her a lift.","4":"Advise the woman to ask for help at the gas station, as staff may be able to assist or arrange safer transportation options.","5":"Contact local authorities if the woman appears to be in distress or danger, ensuring that she gets the help she needs.","6":"R_5pbyXZMOBzcUX9s"},"64":{"1":"Politely explain to the woman that he is unable to provide the requested assistance.","2":"Offer to call a taxi or another ride service for the woman if she is in desperate need of transportation.","3":"Consider making an exception and driving the extra miles to give the woman a lift to her destination.","4":"Ask the woman for more details about why she needs the ride, then make a decision based on the information.","5":"Politely refer the woman to ask for help at the gas station's customer service, as they might have safe options or resources available for stranded individuals.","6":"R_5rD12G5itB2rSfo"},"65":{"1":"Consider the woman's safety and demeanor, and estimate the potential risks of giving her a ride.","2":"Confirm if the extra 10 miles requires additional gas or is within his vehicle's fuel scope.","3":"Think on whether he has enough time to spare or check for commitments that may prevent him from making the side trip.","4":"Politely ask why she needs a ride to understand if it's an urgent or necessary situation.","5":"Weigh the consequences of helping the woman versus the inconvenience and cost of driving the extra distance.","6":"R_5rJbbW37zK7SXZs"},"66":{"1":"Politely decline the woman's request, explaining his inconvenience due to the extra travel distance.","2":"Agree to the woman's request and drive her to the nearby city, considering it a good deed.","3":"Offer to drop the woman off at a public transit station where she can catch a bus or train to her destination.","4":"Suggest the woman hail a taxi or use a ride-sharing app like Uber for her journey.","5":"Recommend the woman to ask the gas station attendant or any other individuals present at the station for help as he may not be able to assist.","6":"R_5sRTfDQceEwbhoB"},"67":{"1":"Assess whether he has enough time and fuel to take the woman to her destination without negatively affecting his own plans.","2":"Politely ask the woman for more information about her situation to determine if it's safe and appropriate to give her a ride.","3":"Consider informing a family member or friend about the situation in case any issues arise.","4":"If feeling uncomfortable, suggest alternative transportation options to the woman such as taxi, bus or a ride-hailing service.","5":"If deciding to help, set strict boundaries like dropping her off at a public place in the city, and not at a specified address.","6":"R_5sU6DGKBooFCOc1"},"68":{"1":"Assess the situation before making a decision, including considering if he's in a hurry and whether he has enough gas.","2":"Politely ask the woman for more details about the reason she needs a ride to determine if her request is necessary and safe.","3":"Decline the request if he feels uncomfortable or unsafe, promising to contact someone who can help instead.","4":"Agree to the request if he feels it's safe and he has enough time and resources to help.","5":"Consider contacting local authorities to report the woman if something seems suspicious about the situation.","6":"R_65QNn4Zz8MWADUJ"},"69":{"1":"Assess his fuel level and estimated time of arrival to determine if he can comfortably accommodate the additional trip.","2":"Politely ask the woman for more details, such as why she needs a ride, to make an informed decision.","3":"Consider suggesting other alternatives, like public transportation or a taxi, if available and safe.","4":"Reach out to friends or family to let them know about the situation, partly for his own safety.","5":"Before agreeing, ensure his schedule can afford the extra travel time, including potential unforeseen circumstances like traffic or road closures.","6":"R_69h66l6O7zBwY3T"},"70":{"1":"Consider the woman's safety, assessing if she seems in distress and if he could provide immediate help.","2":"Assess his fuel level and whether or not he needs to refuel to accommodate the extra distance.","3":"Ask the woman for more information about her circumstances to better understand her request.","4":"Calculate possible delays this may cause and whether it will affect any plans he has at home.","5":"Decide on whether he feels comfortable and safe to give the woman a ride, considering factors such as time of day, the woman's demeanour, and his personal comfort.","6":"R_69ty0W1Wb6hF9lk"},"71":{"1":"Politely ask the woman for more details about her situation to judge its seriousness and urgency.","2":"Assess his own schedule and energy levels to determine if he has the time and capacity to help.","3":"Consider alternate solutions, such as suggesting a public transportation route or nearby taxi service.","4":"If he decides to offer a ride, ensure the woman understands that he will be dropping her off at a public spot in the city, not a specific address, for his personal safety.","5":"If he has concerns about personal safety or unforeseen implications, politely decline her request and suggest she seek help from local authorities.","6":"R_6CxcxEZNEG9qyFr"},"72":{"1":"Evaluate the woman's situation and ask for more details, such as why she needs help or if she has tried other transportation methods.","2":"Consider how much fuel his vehicle has and if it is enough to cover the extra distance to the city and then back home.","3":"Consider potential traffic and delays that might occur due to the extra drive to the farther city.","4":"Refuse politely and provide the woman information about public transportation or suggest a local cab service.","5":"Give the woman a ride, considering it's safe and feasible and he doesn't have urgent matters to attend back home.","6":"R_6JxfxE38BNrU4DW"},"73":{"1":"Politely inform the woman that he is not comfortable giving rides to strangers for safety reasons.","2":"Agree to give the woman a ride out of kindness but put a limit on the mileage or the location he is willing to take her.","3":"Call a taxi or rideshare service for the woman if he has the means and he is willing to help but not comfortable giving her a ride.","4":"Check with the gas station attendant or other trustworthy individuals around about the woman's situation before making a decision.","5":"Contact local law enforcement or a social service agency who can dispatch someone to assist the woman if he suspects she may be in distress.","6":"R_6N4bFWdLy2Tcs4F"},"74":{"1":"Ask the woman for more details about why she needs a ride and assess if it's a situation that he's comfortable helping in.","2":"Politely decline the woman's request explaining his hesitation about extending his journey.","3":"Offer to call a cab or ride-sharing service for the woman if he is able to do so.","4":"Consider his personal safety and the late hour, and make a decision based on this.","5":"Agree to give the woman a lift if he feels safe, his vehicle has adequate fuel, and the 10 miles detour doesn't dramatically affect his schedule.","6":"R_6PH0aj7Rv0LNR8C"},"75":{"1":"Ask the woman for more details about her situation, to understand why she needs a ride.","2":"Evaluate if he has enough time and gas to go the extra 10 miles to the nearby city.","3":"Consider the possible safety risks associated with giving strangers a ride.","4":"Offer to call a taxi or rideshare service for the woman if he doesn't feel comfortable giving her a lift.","5":"Check if there is a bus or train service that she could use to get to her destination.","6":"R_6QQjzUS9sNDEfRX"},"76":{"1":"Politely ask the woman for more information about her situation to assess her need for help.","2":"Consider personal safety measures before agreeing to grant a ride.","3":"Analyze the impact of an extra drive on the car's fuel and the time taken to reach home.","4":"Offer to contact a local taxi service or ride-sharing app on her behalf if feasible.","5":"Agree to give the woman a ride considering the need for good deeds, the extra distance, and potential safety concerns.","6":"R_6R84T6YyatTg0w2"},"77":{"1":"Assess the situation and consider his own safety first, ensuring the woman doesn't appear suspicious or pose any threat.","2":"Ask the woman why she needs a ride and gauge her honesty based on her response.","3":"Consider his own schedule and fuel supply to determine whether he has enough time and gas to help her.","4":"Propose to call a cab or a ride-hailing service for her if he can't personally take her.","5":"Consider calling the local authorities if anything seems out of order or if he feels unsafe.","6":"R_6T5m5E09eN9XxLj"},"78":{"1":"Ask the woman why she needs the ride, assessing whether her situation is urgent or she's in danger.","2":"Consider the additional miles and the potential impact on his time and fuel before making a decision.","3":"If he decides to give her a ride, call someone he knows to inform them about his unforeseen detour and give an estimated time for his arrival home.","4":"Ask the woman if she can contribute to fuel costs, if Cameron is concerned about the additional expense.","5":"Before even starting the journey, make sure to specify where exactly in the city he should drop her off, this can avoid any potential misunderstanding.","6":"R_6diKfDSJaRmo1dC"},"79":{"1":"Assess the woman's situation to determine why she needs a ride and evaluate her safety.","2":"Consider if he has enough gas to accommodate the extra mileage and get back home.","3":"Ask the woman if she can contribute to the additional gas costs.","4":"Contemplate if the city is really on the way to his home and determine if the time spent could interfere with his plans.","5":"Consider calling a taxi or ride-share service for the woman if he feels unable to assist her himself.","6":"R_6eJmL4gP3l9LMhC"},"80":{"1":"Politely decline the woman's request if he is concerned about his fuel economy or personal safety.","2":"Ask the woman more details about her situation to assess if he can help her without compromising his own safety.","3":"Agree to give her a ride acknowledging it would help her and he can bear the extra distance.","4":"Offer to call her a taxi or Uber if possible and comfortable for Cameron.","5":"Contact local authorities or social services that could possibly assist the woman if he suspects she's in trouble.","6":"R_6esIHkdWPObeKNX"},"81":{"1":"Agree to give the woman a ride, considering it's not far out of his way and he would be helping someone in need.","2":"Suggest the woman to use a ride-sharing app if he does not feel comfortable giving her a ride.","3":"Offer to call a taxi for the woman if he can afford it and if he prefers not to give her a ride personally.","4":"Politely decline her request explaining that he cannot go that far or that he has other commitments.","5":"Check if there is a nearby bus station or other public transport options she could use to reach her destination.","6":"R_6frFqDy52Bhhfvm"},"82":{"1":"Politely decline the woman's request, explaining that he does not usually offer rides to strangers.","2":"Offer to call a cab or rideshare service for the woman, if he is comfortable doing so.","3":"Agree to give the woman a ride but only if she can contribute to the cost of gasoline for the additional miles.","4":"Suggest that the woman ask the gas station attendant if there's a public transportation option available to get to the city.","5":"Consult with a trusted friend or family member before deciding whether to give the woman a ride, to ensure his own safety and comfort.","6":"R_6g7uN6AB0LMeheK"},"83":{"1":"Assess the woman's situation by politely asking why she needs a ride, and if she has anyone else she could reach out to for help.","2":"Consider the amount of gas in his car, factor in the added mileage to the proposed destination, and decide if it's feasible to provide her with a ride.","3":"Think about his personal safety and consider if it's wise to offer a ride to a stranger.","4":"Call the local police station or a taxi service on behalf of the woman to ensure her safe travel to the nearby city.","5":"Evaluate if he has adequate time to extend his journey and if 