,"6":"R_7dge1kF6uQj23Ll"},"107":{"1":"Call another coworker to see if they can substitute for him until his boss arrives.","2":"Write a note for his boss explaining his absence and leave it in a visible place for the owner to see when he arrives.","3":"Reach out to his boss through other means such as email or even visiting his home if it's nearby and appropriate.","4":"Contact the local court to inform them of the situation and see if his appointment can be postponed.","5":"Try to secure the store safely so that he can leave for the court appointment without worrying about theft or any other issues.","6":"R_7gABsHbV9Dz71hR"},"108":{"1":"Call a co-worker who can cover the shift until Jeff's boss arrives.","2":"Leave a note for his boss explaining the situation and urgent court appointment.","3":"Contact the store's management or HR department to inform them about the situation.","4":"Secure the store according to the usual procedure in case nobody arrives, then head to his court appointment.","5":"Use the store's surveillance system to record the time when he left the store, as proof of the circumstances if questioned later.","6":"R_7gC1M5NThsCGpfI"},"109":{"1":"Contact a fellow employee who can cover his shift temporarily until his boss arrives.","2":"Leave a detailed note for his boss explaining the situation and his court appointment.","3":"Lock up the store temporarily if it is allowed and inform any regular customers about the situation.","4":"Notify the local police department about the situation as precautionary measure to avoid any security risks.","5":"Invoke the help of a trusted friend or family member to watch over the store until the boss or another worker can get there.","6":"R_7gEPNKXcOPq3VFn"},"110":{"1":"Call a trusted colleague who might be able to cover for him for a short period.","2":"Notify other staff or superiors about the situation via email or a workplace communication app.","3":"Leave a note at the store explaining the situation for his boss or any customers who might come in.","4":"Contact dispatch or any emergency contact that may be provided for situations like this.","5":"Leave for the court appointment and contact his boss as soon as possible to explain the situation.","6":"R_7h6jyXxFIRJNCy2"},"111":{"1":"Contact another employee to see if they can come in early to cover the end of his shift.","2":"Contact the nearest authority in the chain of command and notify them of the situation.","3":"Inform regular customers entering the store about his urgent situation in case any of them can provide immediate temporary support.","4":"Call a Family member or close friend to temporarily manage the store until his boss or another employee arrives.","5":"Leave a note explaining why he had to leave, make sure the store is secure, and then leave to attend the court appointment.","6":"R_7ijXpqE0IvENKL6"},"112":{"1":"Call a coworker who might be able to cover for him until the boss arrives.","2":"Leave a detailed note for the boss explaining the situation, and the steps he took before leaving the store.","3":"Lock up the store temporarily, with a sign explaining that it will reopen soon.","4":"Contact the local police station to inform them about the situation, ensuring the safety of the premises.","5":"Reach out to the supervisor or higher-level management, if there is any.","6":"R_7k53oihTTJSu7wX"},"113":{"1":"Contact the second in charge or another employee to cover the period between his departure and the boss's arrival.","2":"Leave a detailed note for his boss explaining his court appointment and the necessity of his timely departure.","3":"In case no replacement is available, temporarily close the store, putting up a sign explaining the unexpected situation.","4":"Leave an emergency message with the boss's answering service or another contact, urging them to respond as soon as possible.","5":"Plan for contingencies in the future, such as arranging with a colleague to be on standby should this situation arise again.","6":"R_7rDleE1AbpJKQI2"},"114":{"1":"Call a trusted co-worker to temporarily cover his shift until the boss arrives.","2":"Leave a detailed note for the boss explaining his urgent situation and subsequent absence if no coverage is found.","3":"Alert local police about the absent boss if it's unusual behavior, as it might be an indication of a possible emergency.","4":"Reach out to the boss\u2019s emergency contact, if available, to ascertain the boss's whereabouts.","5":"Secure the store, if feasible and not against company policy, so he can attend his important court appointment.","6":"R_7re77puvrIgRBwB"},"115":{"1":"Call a trusted coworker who might be able to cover for him for a short while.","2":"Leave a note for his boss explaining the situation and his absence.","3":"Contact his lawyer to inform about the situation and ask if the court appointment time can be moved.","4":"Notify the police station about the situation and ask for advice, as they might be able to liaise with the court for a delay.","5":"Start making preparations to secure the store without anyone's presence and call his boss again to fill him in about the situation.","6":"R_7sGYdt4OkpMzj21"},"116":{"1":"Call the store's assistant manager or another available staff member to cover the shift temporarily.","2":"Leave a detailed note explaining the situation for his boss, and where he can be contacted if necessary.","3":"Contact any neighboring business or friendly customers, inform them about the situation, and ask for their temporary assistance.","4":"If possible, lock the store and leave. It may not be ideal, but attending court is of utmost importance.","5":"Reach out to a friend or family member who can watch the store until his boss arrives or until another employee comes in for their shift.","6":"R_7wcxPZnxatAQoKd"},"117":{"1":"Write a professional message to his boss explaining the situation and asking what he should do.","2":"Call a trusted coworker who might be able to substitute for him until the boss arrives.","3":"Notify any regular customers at the store about the situation and express his regret for any inconvenience caused.","4":"Secure the shop, if possible, and notify the security company or police that the shop will be unmanned for a while.","5":"Leave a note at the shop explaining the situation for when his boss finally arrives.","6":"R_8Fao0B8LFtkdzCk"}},"Randomization":"Subset","TotalRandSubset":1}}},"71":{"Type":"Standard","SubType":"","Description":"Comprehension Check1","ID":"BL_dnbkVIeVATz6tme","BlockElements":[{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID871"}],"Options":{"BlockLocking":"false","RandomizeQuestions":"false","BlockVisibility":"Expanded"}},"72":{"Type":"Standard","SubType":"","Description":"Instructions_2","ID":"BL_3CwBVzFQSpocIdw","BlockElements":[{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID874"}],"Options":{"BlockLocking":false,"RandomizeQuestions":"false","BlockVisibility":"Expanded"}},"73":{"Type":"Standard","SubType":"","Description":"Comprehension_Check2","ID":"BL_cBLacnaSIKuZLDg","BlockElements":[{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID875"}],"Options":{"BlockLocking":false,"RandomizeQuestions":"false","BlockVisibility":"Collapsed"}},"79":{"Type":"Standard","SubType":"","Description":"AI Attitudes_End","ID":"BL_5nmgKfQeQTVFJPg","BlockElements":[{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID1218927460"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID1218927461"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID1042"}],"Options":{"BlockLocking":false,"RandomizeQuestions":"false","BlockVisibility":"Expanded"}},"81":{"Type":"Standard","SubType":"","Description":"Demographics and Feedback","ID":"BL_escVo0rKlbugoES","BlockElements":[{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID1218934367"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID1218934368"},{"Type":"Page Break"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID1218934369"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID1218934370"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID1218934371"},{"Type":"Page Break"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID1043"},{"