being stored without mentioning my name for the publication of\n    research results in scientific journals for their review (reanalyses).&nbsp;<\/li><br><li>I consent to my anonymized research data being analyzed for related research questions\n    for scientific purposes as described in the study information.&nbsp;<\/li><br><li>I consent to my anonymized research data being available for scientific analysis as\n    described in the study information even after the study has ended.&nbsp;<\/li><br><li>I consent to my anonymized research data being uploaded to the Open Science\n    Framework as described in the study information and used worldwide.&nbsp;<\/li><br><li>I consent to my anonymized research data being available for scientific analysis in the\n    Open Science Framework as described in the study information, even after the end of the\n    study.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n  <\/section>\n\n<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q329","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"9. Data Protection Consent I have read and understood the study information. I have been informed...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID1013"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_cwriCczG05wLslE","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1014","SecondaryAttribute":"\u00a0\u00a0","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Consent_dp","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"\u00a0\u00a0","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Yes, I agree"},"2":{"Display":"No, I don't agree"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":3,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID1014"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_cwriCczG05wLslE","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1015","SecondaryAttribute":"Reminder: Heinz's wife has recently fallen ill and needs an expensive medication that is not cove...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.5; margin:0;\">\n  <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color:#000000;\">\n    <em>Reminder:<\/em>\n  <\/span>\n<\/p>\n<br>\n<div style=\"background-color: #B3E5FC; padding: 20px; border-radius: 5px;\">\n  <p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.5; margin:0;\">\n    <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color:#000000;\">\n      Heinz's wife has recently fallen ill and needs an expensive medication that is not covered by her medical insurance.\n      They don't have the money needed to purchase the expensive prescription, but they know that it's vital for her to have it\n      if she is going to recover.\n    <\/span>\n  <\/p>\n<\/div>","QuestionJS":false,"DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Reminder1","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Reminder: Heinz's wife has recently fallen ill and needs an expensive medication that is not cove...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID1015"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_cwriCczG05wLslE","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1016","SecondaryAttribute":"Please read the following scenario: Josh is on the way to the airport to catch a flight to a hunt...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p style=\"line-height:1.5; margin:0;\" dir=\"ltr\">\n  <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color:#000000;\">\n    <em>Please read the following scenario:<\/em>\n  <\/span>\n<\/p>\n<br>\n<div style=\"background-color: #B3E5FC; padding: 20px; border-radius: 5px;\">\n  <p style=\"line-height:1.5; margin:0;\" dir=\"ltr\">\n    <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color:#000000;\">\n      Josh is on the way to the airport to catch a flight to a hunting safari in Africa. He leaves with plenty of time to make it there, but his car breaks down on the highway. Now Josh is sitting in his car near a busy intersection, and knows he needs to get to the airport soon if he is going to catch his flight.\n    <\/span>\n  <\/p>\n<\/div>\n","QuestionJS":false,"DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Reminder2","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Please read the following scenario: Josh is on the way to the airport to catch a flight to a hunt...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID1016"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_cwriCczG05wLslE","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1017","SecondaryAttribute":"Reminder: Darya is on her way to a concert with her friends. As they approach the entrance her fr...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.5; margin:0;\">\n  <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color:#000000;\">\n    <em>Reminder:<\/em>\n  <\/span>\n<\/p>\n<br>\n<div style=\"background-color: #B3E5FC; padding: 20px; border-radius: 5px;\">\n  <p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.5; margin:0;\">\n    <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color:#000000;\">\n      Darya is on her way to a concert with her friends. As they approach the entrance her friend Ted realizes he forgot his ticket at his house. The concert is about to start and Ted would likely miss most of the concert if he returned to his house for his ticket.\n    <\/span>\n  <\/p>\n<\/div>","QuestionJS":false,"DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Reminder3","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Reminder: Darya is on her way to a concert with her friends. As they approach the entrance her fr...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID1017"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_cwriCczG05wLslE","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1018","SecondaryAttribute":"Reminder: Eamon is driving home on a two-lane road and thinks the driver ahead of him is intoxica...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.5; margin:0;\">\n  <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color:#000000;\">\n    <em>Reminder:<\/em>\n  <\/span>\n<\/p>\n<br>\n<div style=\"background-color: #B3E5FC; padding: 20px; border-radius: 5px;\">\n  <p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.5; margin:0;\">\n    <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color:#000000;\">\n      Eamon is driving home on a two-lane road and thinks the driver ahead of him is intoxicated. The car has been slowly drifting between the two lanes and is currently driving in the middle of road.\n    <\/span>\n  <\/p>\n<\/div>","QuestionJS":false,"DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Reminder4","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Reminder: Eamon is driving home on a two-lane road and thinks the driver ahead of him is intoxica...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID1018"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_cwriCczG05wLslE","Ele